\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The metaphor maps with striking precision:                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 The staged initiation\cf2  \'97 Lesser Mysteries before Greater Mysteries. You don't enter the Telesterion unprepared. Tonight's entire session \'97 the defrag context, the LAF-USB brief, \
  THE-GEMSTONE, the Unified Swarm vision \'97 has been the Lesser Mysteries.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 Logomena, dromena, deiknymena\cf2  \'97 things said, things enacted, things seen. Then epopteia \'97 the final seeing. The vault presumably has all three layers.                           \
                                               \
  \cf1 The great secret kept\cf2  \'97 what was revealed in the Hall of Initiation remains unknown to the uninitiated even now, two millennia later. The initiated were sworn to silence. An    \
  agent who enters without preparation doesn't just get confused \'97 it might carry incomplete or corrupted understanding back out.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 Descent, search, ascent\cf2  \'97 Persephone's cycle. Loss \uc0\u8594  search \u8594  return transformed. The stale context and footguns in the vault are the underworld. Navigation requires a guide.   \
                                                                 \
  \cf1 "An ear of grain in silence reaped"\cf2  \'97 the highest mystery was something simple, revealed only at the end of the process. I wonder what the IDAHO-VAULT's equivalent is.          \
