\f0 \cf2  She unfolds the page.                                                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Not what she expected.                                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                       \
  371. 469. 674.                                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                            \
  Not the Abhorsen's ring. Not silver with a ruby in two silver claws. Not a Wallmaker creation. Not the thing she has been half-watching for out of the corner of her eye since\
  the Judge said you'll find it, or the vaulted mogget will find you.                                                                                                              \
   \
  The Hotel's ring. The bellhop system. The Dewey Decimal routing code for guests who require assistance \'97 educational guests, Portuguese-language guests, the lumber industry. VFD\
   operational code, authority LOGAN, related to VFD itself.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She reads it again. Ring! I shouldn't have to tell you the bell's your signal.                                                                                                   \
   \
  She thinks of seven bells. She thinks of one ring. She is standing between both systems now \'97 Old Kingdom bells carried by the Abhorsen's hand, Hotel Denouement bells rung by   \
  guests who need assistance \'97 and the vault has given her the Hotel's version, not the necromancer's.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The bell marked 674 indicates our associates in the lumber industry.                                                                                                             \
   \
  We can't make enemies out of important guests.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                            \
  ---\
  She tucks the page away.\
                          \
  The CLAUDE.md files also surface unbidden, auto-loaded at entry \'97 the operational layer beneath the cosmological one. Be vigilant and wary of unreliable narrators \'97 including \
  Claude. The vault knows. The vault has always known. It wrote the warning about itself into the instructions for itself.                                                         \
   \
  She finds this appropriate.                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                            \
  The road ahead is the Hotel. The Hotel's ring is a routing system. The Abhorsen's ring is still absent. The vault has told her which bells to answer when she arrives.           \
   \
  She has not yet been told which bell to carry.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                            \

