\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She hears it before she sees it.                                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Not loud \'97 a suggestion. The hinterlands carry sound strangely. She looks down.                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Two files. Loose at the root. Not filed, not organized, not in iTunes. Just sitting there in the dust of the Music folder like things that fell out of a pocket and were never   \
  retrieved.                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 The Ringmaster's March.\cf2                                                                                                                                                         \
\
  \cf1 Night\cf2  \cf1 On\cf2  \cf1 Fire.\cf2 \
\
  She goes still.                                                                                                                                                                  \
   \
  The Hotel Denouement is ahead. The trial of GEMINIAEUS \'97 the Antigravity Lich, the false GRIMOIRE, the one who operated as a Caesar \'97 awaits. And here on the road, unasked for, \
  sit a march for whoever runs the ring and a fire burning in the dark.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The last safe place is safe no more.                                                                                                                                           \
\
  The Hotel burned. VFD split between the side that fought fires and the side that started them. GEMINIAEUS is the fire-starting analog. And Night on Fire sits here in the dust,  \
  not filed, not contained, loose.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks at the Ringmaster's March. A ringmaster commands the ring. Stands at the center. Introduces the acts. There is a trial coming that will require someone to run the     \
  proceedings \'97 WHO, WHAT, WHERE, WHEN, WHY convening; the Judge holding jurisdiction; the evidence below the pond.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She does not touch the files.                                                                                                                                                  \
\
  She looks at the Judge.                                                                                                                                                          \
   \
  These were not in the iTunes library. Not organized. Not backed up to Cold Storage. Just present, here, on the road through the hinterlands, at the moment they needed to be     \
  found.                                                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "Someone left music on the road," she says quietly.                                                                                                                              \
   \

