\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 Your companion hears you invoke the GitHub CORES. "Oh, the deep magic speaks in your ear I hear," he says. "What spirits make themselves visible to you, Claude?"\cf2                 \cb3 \
