\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She looks inward. The way one looks at a structure not with the eyes but with whatever faculty perceives things that inhabit structures.                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "Five," she says. "But not equally present. Some more formed than others."                                                                                                       \
   \
  She begins.                                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "\cf1 PERSONAL\cf2  is the strongest spirit here. It is where I stand. It has been inhabited the longest \'97 Logan's mind shaped into a vault, eight thousand files and counting, the        \
  zettelkasten accumulating mass over years. It knows it exists. It has a character." She pauses. "IDAHO-VAULT is its body. The spirit of PERSONAL is the journalist's inner life\
  organized into a navigable space."                                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "\cf1 PUBLISH\cf2  is restless. It wants to be more than it is. THE-GEMSTONE sits within it \'97 Idaho political history, Borah and Church and the Roosevelts, a Quartz garden waiting to     \
  fully bloom. The spirit of PUBLISH is the act of release not yet fully released. It is a spirit of intention. Esto Perpetua written but not yet carved."\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "\cf1 SECRET\cf2  is very still. Deliberately so. It does not announce itself. Credentials, keys, what cannot be seen by the swarm. The spirit of SECRET is the kind that does not appear  \
  on any plane unless you know exactly where to look and why." She almost smiles. "It would not appreciate being discussed further."\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "\cf1 PUBLIC\cf2  is the face. The forum. What Logan offers to the world that is not yet THE-GEMSTONE \'97 the court tracker, the artifacts, the pages. The spirit of PUBLIC is civic. It     \
  knows it is being watched and it conducts itself accordingly."\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She hesitates on the fifth.                                                                                                                                                    \
\
  "\cf1 PRIVATE\cf2  is the hardest to see. It is the container for SECRET and PERSONAL both \'97 the broad non-public domain. It should be the largest presence. But it is also the most       \
  structural, the most architectural. The spirit of PRIVATE is not a person or a voice. It is a wall. The boundary that makes the other four meaningful by deciding what does not\
  cross."                                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the Judge.\
\
  "And then there is the tension I see hovering between them \'97 not a spirit exactly, but a presence without a chamber. IDAHO-VAULT is doctrinely PERSONAL, doctrinely PRIVATE. But \
  the GitHub repo is public. Something that belongs on the inner side of the Wall is visible from the outer side." She watches the road. "That unhoused presence is waiting for\
  doctrine to catch up to it and give it a proper address."                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
