\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads what surfaces. Then reads it again.                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "The Soul Has Many Motions," she says quietly.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Ringmaster's March is not a standalone piece. It is the fourth movement of a suite \'97 John Mackey, North Texas Wind Symphony. The suite is called The Soul Has Many Motions.  \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the Judge.                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "Logan is THE-GEMSTONE. Many facets, one gemstone. The soul has many motions. The Ringmaster's March is one motion of that soul \'97 the presiding motion, the commanding motion,   \
  the one that stands at the center of the ring and calls the acts forward." She pauses. "Not just the Carnivorous Carnival. Not just GEMINIAEUS. The march is what it sounds like\
  when the soul moves into that particular register."                                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She files this. Then turns to the second file.                                                                                                                                   \
