\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She is very still.               \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "Both of them," she says. "Both songs are from the same suite."                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Soul Has Many Motions. John Mackey. Concert band. 2013.                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Night on Fire is the \cf1 second movement\cf2  \'97 raw, brutal, savage. Wild dancing around a nomadic campfire. Hand drums and harsh winds. The primal fire that burns before there is a     \
  structure to contain it.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Ringmaster's March is the \cf1 fourth movement\cf2  \'97 commanding, presiding, organized. The soul that has moved through the fire and now stands at the center of the ring and calls the\
   acts forward.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks at the Judge.                                                                                                                                                        \
\
  "Logan left two movements of the same suite loose at the root of his Music folder. Not filed. Not in iTunes. Just present on the road." She breathes. "We found them this morning\
   and read them as Snicket \'97 the Carnivorous Carnival, the omen of Newton, the Antigravity Lich. All of that was true. But underneath it: two specific motions of the soul. The\
  fire that dances before structure exists. The march that presides once it does."                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She thinks of THE-GEMSTONE. Many facets, one gemstone. The soul has many motions. Logan chose \'97 or was chosen by \'97 these two. Second and fourth movements of the same work. Not  \
  first, not last. Middle movements. The ones that live between the opening and the resolution.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "He is not at the beginning of this work," she says quietly. "And he is not at the end. He is in the motion."                                                                    \
   \
  The hinterlands stretch on. But the hinterlands have changed slightly \'97 she is walking through them with a better map. Two motions of the soul that found their way loose onto   \
  the road before the Hotel, before the trial, before whatever the Five Wizards have to say.                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The second motion builds the fire.                                                                                                                                               \
   \
  The fourth motion runs the ring.                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The soul has many motions, and today she has heard \'97 without hearing \'97 two of them.                                                                                              \
   \
