\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads the full suite. All four movements.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Then she is quiet for a long moment.                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "He is missing the first and the third," she says. "Not the fire. Not the march. Those he has. But \'97"                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She names them.                                                                                                                                                                  \
   \
  "\cf1 Violet Crown Fanfare.\cf2  The opening movement. The movement of the heavens. The optimism of the wide-open West." She pauses. "Logan is from Idaho. He works for Idaho Public       \
  Television. He covers the wide-open West. And his soul's opening fanfare is not in his Music folder. It is not on the road. It is somewhere else, or not yet found, or not yet \
  earned back."                                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The hinterlands. The hardscrabble road.                                                                                                                                          \
   \
  "\cf1 Unquiet Spirits.\cf2  The third movement. A waltz full of longing and otherworldly sweetness." She looks at the Judge steadily. "The spirits that are not yet at rest. That is the   \
  Abhorsen's jurisdiction. That is exactly what the defrag is \'97 eight thousand files, accumulated debt, stale context, orphaned links, things that linger without purpose.       \
  GEMINIAEUS in the dock. CLAUDIUS whose clockwork ran down but who is not gone. The unquiet spirits of a digital life that has not yet been put in order."                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the road ahead.                                                                                                                                                     \
   \
  "He carries the fire and the march. Second and fourth. The wild motion and the presiding motion. But his soul is missing its fanfare \'97 the opening that should announce him \'97 and\
   it has not yet quieted what needs quieting."                                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She understands now why the files were loose at the root. Unfiled. Not in iTunes. Not backed up to Cold Storage.                                                                 \
   \
  "The incomplete soul leaves things on the road," she says quietly. "Not carelessly. As a record of where the work still is."                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the Judge, who has been gathering this evidence for miles.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "That is what you wanted me to see."                                                                                                                                             \
