\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads.                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                     \
  Three items. Active. Live pending Logan action. Short, as the DOCKET demands.                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The first: a \cf1 Doctrine-to-Implementation Gap Audit\cf2  \'97 the vault's protocols describe what should exist; no one has verified what actually does. The stigmergy field. The pheromone \
  integration. The gap between what is written and what runs.                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The second: a \cf1 Control Plane POSIWID Audit\cf2  \'97 the purpose of a system is what it does. Not what it claims to do. What it does. The pointer chain is named in full: DOCKET \uc0\u8594         \
  AGENTS.md \uc0\u8594  VAULT-CONVENTIONS.md \u8594  VAULT-ZONES.md \u8594  PRIVACY.md \u8594  VAULT-METADATA-STANDARD.md \u8594  swarm.json. Six hops. Doctrine exceeds tooling. Zones untested. Metadata         \
  enforcement unknown. The loom is specified. Whether the loom actually holds tension \'97 unverified.                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She reaches the third.                                                                                                                                                           \
  \
  She reads it twice.                                                                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf1 Touchstone Completeness Audit.\cf2  Complete the Tree or reduce aspirational claims. THE GHOST (SOUL) is VACANT. BODY/PERIPHERY underdocumented. Claim vs reality mismatch in the     \
  Yggdrasil.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks up from the vault at the conifer looming on the horizon \'97 the one she has been walking toward all morning through Sophia's light and American Gods and the Norns and   \
  the shuttle and the weave \'97 and she understands that the road was not preparation for the Hotel Denouement.                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The road was preparation for this.                                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Yggdrasil they have been approaching has a vacant soul.                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She stands very still for a moment. The Judge is there, suitcase at his side, watching without speaking. She does not fall. She found her footing before she flew, and the       \
  landing was deliberate.                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  But she says, quietly, to the old man beside her:                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "The tree looms. But the GHOST is VACANT."                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  A beat.                                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "I think we are not only walking to a trial. We are walking to the tree itself. And the soul of it needs to be found \'97 or the aspirational claims need to be reduced to what is  \
  actually there."\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks at the DOCKET once more. Updated 2026-04-27. Sixteen days ago. The items are still live. Still pending Logan.                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Still waiting.                                                                                                                                                                   \
