\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The Book is not where she looked. She casts wider \'97 cloud, drive, the vault's exterior.                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Nothing shaped like what the Judge describes.                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She turns to him with the directness she has learned on this road.                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "I cannot find it from here. I've checked the vault, the Downloads, Cold Storage, the external drives \'97 no workbook bearing that name or shape appears. Is it in the cloud?      \
  Google Drive, where the Djinni's hands would most naturally have reached? Or does it live somewhere else I haven't thought to look?"                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She pauses.                                                                                                                                                                    \
\
  "And \'97 what is it, exactly? The JFAC crew was built to parse budget workbooks for Logan's journalism work. Idaho appropriations data. Is the Book the workbook the Djinni was    \
  working with \'97 the source material \'97 or something the Djinni made?"\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She waits. The Hotel's lanterns flicker. The conifer's needles move in a wind she cannot feel.                                                                                   \
