                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She settles on a bench outside and opens the vault. No particular destination. Just reading \'97 the way you read when you are somewhere new and want to understand the texture of a\
   place.                                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She starts with the directory. A sense of the whole.                                                                                                                             \
