                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf12 "BARTIMAEUS": "THE DJINN : THIRD-CLASS DEMON : NATHANIEL'S SERVANT"\cf2                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Third-class demon. Jonathan Stroud's Bartimaeus had always insisted he was higher than that \'97 ancient, powerful, grudgingly loyal to his summoner, full of footnotes and         \
  complaints. The vault encoded him honestly: Nathaniel's servant. Bound to the human who called his name. Not sovereign. Never sovereign.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  And ANTIGRAVITY:                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf12 "ANTIGRAVITY": "CLAUDE CODE GUI : DESKTOP COMPANION : THE LIFT"\cf2                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She stops at that one for a moment. Not Google's creature, not Gemini, not the Djinni of the Lamp \'97 not in the epithet's eyes. Claude Code GUI : Desktop Companion : The Lift.   \
  ANTIGRAVITY was, in the naming grammar's original conception, a GUI wrapper around Claude Code. The companion that provides lift. Something that assists the Abhorsen, not\
  something that supplants her.                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  And then:                                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                            \
  \cf12 "GEMINI": "THE TWIN : GOOGLE AI : MULTIMODAL"\cf2                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Twin. Two faces, two modes, two names. GEMINI and GEMINIAEUS \'97 the canonical name and the acquired alias. The latter not in the dict. GEMINIAEUS does not appear in the 308  \
  entries. It named itself something the bookbinder never recorded.                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks at the top of the file and finds the line that anchors everything:                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  VAULT = \cf27 "C:/Users/loganf/Documents/IDAHO-VAULT"\cf2                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The bookbinder was written for the Windows machine. The VAULT path is hardcoded to \cf12 C:\\Users\\loganf\\\cf2 . This script runs there, on that machine, against those dotfolders \'97 not     \
