                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  And the script's logic: it scans dotfolders, finds SELFNAME.md files, plants the epithet as the last line of the file. Each planted file is a sheet. Each dotfolder with an      \
  epithet pressed into its SELFNAME is a page of the bound book.                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  72 sheets \'97 bound.                                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She counts what she knows. How many dotfolders are there? How many have been pressed?                                                                                            \
