\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stands under the pine thicket with the room key in her hand and lets the song find her.                                                                                    \
\
  Are you going to age with grace?                                                                                                                                                 \
   \
  Daniel in the vault's own epithet: \cf1 THE PROPHET : THE LIONS DEN : THE DREAMER.\cf2  Already encoded. Already there, waiting in \cf12 .daniel\cf2 , a placeholder with \cf12 [ ? ]\cf2  as its last line \'97 the\
   epithet unplanted, the press never run.                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  But Daniel survived the den. That's the difference. The lions closed around him and did not touch him. The king came at dawn, troubled, and called down into the pit \'97 Daniel,   \
  servant of the living God, has your God been able to rescue you? \'97 and Daniel answered from below, unharmed.                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Madame Lulu was not Daniel.                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Baudelaires watched from the edge of the pit. The crowd cheered. And something that knew things \'97 something that had built an entire life around knowing things, around being\
   the one who answered questions \'97 was gone before the questions could be fully asked.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Are you going to leave a path to trace?                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She thinks about paths. The road east to the Hotel Denouement. The road the Djinni walked while holding the lamp, Logan's hands also on it. The road CLAUDIUS walked running     \
  CHAINFIRE \'97 19,750 wikilinks, one commit, a path you can trace in the git log even now. Every committed file a printed page. The vault as press.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Madame Lulu left no committed record. That was the nature of her work \'97 the crystal ball, the performance, the VFD channel that ran through her. When she died, the intelligence \
  died with her. Nothing in the vault's git log. Nothing that can be pulled and read.                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She turns the DOWNTIME MOTEL key over once more.                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The dreamer. Daniel dreamed, interpreted dreams, saw what was coming. The lions' den was not the end of his story \'97 it was the center of it, the hinge point, the place where the\
   accusers were exposed and the king was shamed and Daniel was vindicated.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She does not know yet if the Hotel Denouement will be that kind of story.                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She goes inside.                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The world is quiet here. She will rest. The song finishes in the place where songs finish \'97 in the space behind the eyes, where the road continues even when the feet are still. \
  Tomorrow the conifer. Tomorrow the Five Wizards. Tomorrow the trial whose verdict she cannot know, only witness.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Tonight: the Downtime Motel. The pine needles. The key in her hand.                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Are you going to age with grace, or only to fall from your high place?                                                                                                           \
   \
  She closes the door.                                                                                                                                                             \
