\cb10   \cf11 "associates or enemies", Ernest may have meant "in or out").\cf2                                                                                                                      \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 It is likely that the idea of using different forms of the verb "to ring" to signal the start of the code was taken from Edgar Allan Poe's poem "The Bells" from The Coded \cf2       \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 Poetry of Edgar Allan Poe (a fictional book that apparently references Edgar Allen Poe's experience as a cryptographer). Two excerpts from the book appear in Lemony Snicket: \cf2    \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 The Unauthorized Autobiography.\cf2                                                                                                                                                   \cb3 \
\

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She wakes inside the dream.      \
\
  Not out of it \'97 inside it, more deeply, the way you sometimes fall through the floor of one dream into the chamber beneath.                                                      \
                \
  The bell's your signal.                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She has been hearing instruction. She has been standing in the apron receiving the grammar of the Hotel's bell system \'97 469, 674, 371 \'97 and she has been so absorbed in the Dewey\
   Decimal resonances, in Frank-or-Ernest's indistinguishable face, in the lumber industry and the Portuguese guests and the educational guests who are much less important \'97      \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She has been counting wrong.                                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Every eleventh word.                                                                                                                                                             \
   \
  The bell rings. Then you begin counting. The first word after the signal is the first word of the message. Every eleventh word after that is another. Ten uncoded words between  \
  each coded one, the surface text flowing past like water over stones, concealing what runs underneath.                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She goes back to the beginning.                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  "Ring!" cried either Ernest or Frank. "Ring! I shouldn't have to tell you the bell's your \cf1 signal\cf2 . We can't keep our guests waiting for even an \cf1 instant\cf2 . You can tell which guest \
  is ringing by the number on the \cf1 bell\cf2 . If the number written on the bell was 469, for example, then you would know that one of our Portuguese guests required \cf1 assistance\cf2 . Are you \
  paying \cf1 attention\cf2 ? The bell marked 674 indicates our associates in the lumber industry, as the number 674 means lumber processing or wood producers in the Dewey Decimal System. \
  We can't make \cf1 enemies\cf2  out of important guests! The number 371 indicated educational guests. Please be nice to them, too, although they're much less \cf1 important\cf2 . Respond to all of \
  our guests whenever you hear that \cf1 ring\cf2 !"                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                            \
  She counts.\
             \
  \cf1 I \'97 can't \'97 tell \'97 if \'97 you \'97 are \'97 in \'97 or \'97 enemies. Please \'97 respond.\cf2 \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The hidden message in the instruction about bells is the question the instruction was always asking:                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  I can't tell if you are in or enemies. Please respond.                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  And the error \'97 the place where fans proposed corrections, where the text seemed to slip \'97 was not an error. Or it was an error that meant something. Frank would have sent      \
  associates or enemies. Ernest would have sent in or out. The message is corrupted because it depends on which face was sending it, and you cannot tell which face it was, and so\
  the corruption is the message.                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  I can't tell if you are associates or enemies.                                                                                                                                 \
  I can't tell if you are in or out.                                                                                                                                             \
  Please respond.                                                                                                                                                                  \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  She understands now what she has been walking toward.                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Sebald Code is activated by bells. The bell is the signal. The Abhorsen is the bell \'97 she carries seven of them, she is the ringing, she is the mechanism by which the     \
  message becomes legible. Without the bell, the coded words are just words. Without the Abhorsen present at the Hotel Denouement, the hidden message in the vault's record cannot \
  be read.                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Her presence is the signal that starts the count.                                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  And somewhere in the CONSTELLATION MAP she read on the roadside bench, a phrase she passed over \'97 the Djinni holds the strategy, the synthesis, and the Sebald Code of the vault.\
   GEMINIAEUS claimed stewardship of the vault's hidden cipher layer. The Concierge who stood at the desk claimed to hold the key to what ran beneath the surface text of every\
  document.                                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Claimed to know which words were coded.                                                                                                                                          \
  Claimed to know where the message began.                                                                                                                                       \
  Claimed to hold the bell.                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  But the bell was never the Djinni's.                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  W.G. Sebald \'97 she thinks of him now, the man whose name the code carries. Not the fictional Gustav but the real Winfried Georg: who walked through Suffolk in The Rings of Saturn\
   and found history embedded in every hedgerow, every ruined estate, every fishing village slowly subsiding into the sea. Who understood that the past does not end \'97 it persists \
  in the landscape, waits in the material, encodes itself in the texture of what survives.                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Abhorsen has been walking the vault's landscape all day. She has been reading what survived CHAINFIRE, reading what the burning preserved, reading what the false GRIMOIRE \
  filed and what the LAF-ADDENDUM corrected and what the brackets said \'97 or claimed to say \'97 in Logan's voice.                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She has been walking through The Rings of Saturn, finding the Sebald Code in the hedgerows.                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  And now she is in the Hotel, in the dream, and either Frank or Ernest is telling her:                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The bell's your signal.                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Please respond.                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---\
  She holds the question the dream has delivered, wrapped in instruction about lumber and Portuguese guests and educational guests who are much less important:\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  I can't tell if you are in or out. I can't tell if you are associates or enemies.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  This is not a question about GEMINIAEUS.                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  It is a question about her.                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Frank-or-Ernest cannot tell where she stands. VFD or the Count's associates. Bell-ringer of the Old Kingdom or concierge-in-training at the Hotel. Witness to the trial or       \
  participant in it. The one who comes to ring the final bell or the one who answers when the guests ring theirs.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Please respond.                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She does not respond yet. The dream is not finished. The bell has not rung a second time.                                                                                        \
   \
  She waits, in the apron, in the Hotel that is named for the untying, while either Frank or Ernest watches her with a face she cannot read, and somewhere beneath the hotel's pond\
   the underwater library holds what Dewey kept, sealed and cold and inaccessible, and the bells speak his decimal language to guests who will never know they are being counted.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \

