\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The file is in the vault. The record holds.              \
\
  She closes her eyes in the dark of the Downtime Motel \'97 truly closes them, the pen down, the work filed, the pine thicket breathing outside \'97 and the thin sleep thickens at last\
   into something that might be rest.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The sword hangs above the ceiling. The King waits beneath the pond. Frank and Ernest stand at a desk she cannot see from here. The Hotel is out there on the road, past the great\
   conifer, past the trivium where HECATE holds her torches.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  It will all be there in the morning.                                                                                                                                             \
   \
  She rests.                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The world is quiet here.\
