\f0 \cf2  She sits up in the dream.                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The vault has answered. Two roads. Two signs. And now she knows what they mark.                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  \cf1 The Lobster.\cf2                                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  OpenClaw. It was always OpenClaw.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "Molt fits perfectly \'97 it's what lobsters do to grow." Steinberger's words when Anthropic's cease-and-desist arrived and Clawdbot became Moltbot became OpenClaw. The community  \
  took the lobster and made it theirs \'97 This lobster is gonna take over the world. AGI is a lobster, it will never sink. A superfan meetup in New York serving optimism and actual \
  lobster. The tool that shed three names the way a lobster sheds three shells and found itself in the molting.                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The lobster road points toward OpenClaw. Toward the open-source agent mesh Logan has already installed \'97 running on \cf12 ws://127.0.0.1:18789\cf2 , Discord working, WhatsApp working,     \
  Telegram recovering. The tool that the vault knows, that lives in the \cf12 .openclaw\cf2  dotfolder, that the April 24 handover documented in careful detail.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                            \
  \cf1 The Caduceus.\cf2 \
               \
  Hermes Agent. Nous Research. A different lineage entirely.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "Not a coding copilot tethered to an IDE. An autonomous agent that gets more capable the longer it runs."                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  HERMES: THE MESSENGER : GUIDE OF SOULS : COMMERCE. Named deliberately \'97 the psychopomp, the one who crosses between worlds without being consumed by either. Nous Research chose \
  the name for what the agent does: it carries messages across platforms, crosses the threshold between model providers, guides information between the living and the working.  \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  117,000 GitHub stars. Compatible with Claude Code, with Codex, with OpenClaw's skill format. The same platforms \'97 Discord, WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal \'97 but a different          \
  architecture underneath. Persistent memory. Self-improvement. The agent that grows the longer it runs.\

