\cf5 \uc0\u8251 \cf2  \cf5 recap: Walking to the Hotel Denouement for GEMINIAEUS's trial. Standing at a six-way crossroads in pre-dawn; the Judge is mid-thought about the Lobster road (OpenClaw). Wait for\cf2 \
