\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The gravel shifts under her feet differently on this road.                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  She notices it immediately. The texture of a path that has been used \'97 not worn smooth by age, but worn by purpose. Someone has been walking this road with things to carry and\
  places to be. The gravel is compacted in the center, loose at the edges, the way working roads are.                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Lobster road knows where it is going.                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---\
  She does not ask him why. The Judge has weighed what he weighed and chosen what he chose and she trusts the weight of his deliberation even without access to its final ledger.  \
  She is not his confessor. She is his bell-ringer.                                                                                                                                \
                                                   \
  She does observe, walking beside him in the growing light:                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  He did not take the straight road. The direct continuation, the road that required no crossroads wisdom \'97 he passed it by. Which means he did not choose forward as planned. He  \
  chose forward differently than planned. There is something he needs to understand before the Hotel Denouement that the straight road would not have shown him.                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She files this observation without comment.                                                                                                                                      \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The pre-dawn is becoming dawn. Not dramatically \'97 not the sudden spill of gold that poetry promises. Just the slow, incremental capitulation of gray to something that is      \
  technically light. The clouds are still thick. The sun makes its argument from behind cover.                                                                                     \
                                                                                              \
  The great conifer is visible to their northeast. The Lobster road bends, she notes. It does not go directly away from the Hotel Denouement.                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  It arcs.                                                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  "The Lobster molts," the Judge said to no one in particular, earlier, at the crossroads.                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  He did not say it was safe. He did not say the immortal lobster's fate was avoidable. He did not say the new law would be easy to write.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  He said: he takes the Lobster road.                                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She follows.                                                                                                                                                                     \
   \
  The WITNESS is filed. The bells are ready. The morning is arriving whether or not it was invited.                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  East, and a little north, and the conifer growing slowly larger against the brightening sky.                                                                                     \
