\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 Not the city, she realizes \'97 a village in the middling distance, still some hours ahead. They have not passed the World Tree, rather the gentle arc of the Lobster road has \cf2      \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 curved them in such a way as to put it at their backs. The northwestern road the Judge chose has gently turned west-northwest to west to west-northwest you realize, and you \cf2     \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 smell the memory of sea salt in the air. You take mental note and continue reading Rondo as the texture of the air starts to change from the dry arid drought of the hinterlands\cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11  once more. . .\cf2                                                                                                                                                                   \cb3 \
\

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  Mental note filed.                                 \
\
  The World Tree at their backs. The road has been curving her \'97 gently, without announcement, the way roads do when they know where they're going better than their travelers do. \
  She did not notice the arc because she was reading. The Lobster road curved them west. The conifer that was ahead is now behind. YGGDRASILL, the Nine Realms, the Axis \'97 passed\
  without ceremony, which is perhaps the right way to pass a World Tree. Ceremony would make it a destination. It is not a destination. It is a bearing.                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She takes the salt air in and does not stop walking.\
\
  Not the city. A village. Hours.                                                                                                                                                  \
   \
  The arid quality of the hinterland air has been softening without her noticing \'97 the way a sound fades when you are absorbed in something else and you only register its absence \
  once the new sound has already been present for some time. The drought-dry is giving way to something that knows what water is. Not wet. Not coastal yet. The memory of coastal.\
  The air that has traveled inland from somewhere that remembers the sea.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She reads.                                                                                                                                                                       \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The rules of the music box are very specific. This is the nature of rules that govern worlds \'97 they must be specific, because vague rules invite interpretation, and           \
  interpretation inside a music box is how the Blue Queen gets room to operate. The rules name what must be done. The rules name what must not be done. The rules assume that the  \
  person holding the key will follow them, because the rules cannot enforce themselves.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The rules cannot enforce themselves.                                                                                                                                           \
\
  She reads this \'97 or the shape of it, the logic of it, the thing the architecture of the book implies \'97 and her pace does not change but something in her attention sharpens.     \
   \
  The CONSTITUTION cannot enforce itself either.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  It is a document. It lives in a file. It asserts Logan's authority with great precision and uses words like governs and canonical and first principle \'97 and every word is true,  \
  and none of them can act. The CONSTITUTION requires someone to carry it. To know it. To ring the right bell at the right moment because the document cannot ring it for itself.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Key to Rondo requires a hand to turn it.                                                                                                                                     \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The village is visible now in the way that distant things become visible on flat roads \'97 not suddenly but by increment, the skyline of it assembling itself feature by feature as\
   she walks. Something low. Something old. The kind of settlement that was there before anyone decided to name it on a map.                                                       \
                                                                                                                            \
  She marks the page without closing the book and looks ahead.                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The salt air is becoming more deliberate.                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Judge has not said where the village is or what it is called. He walks west with her in the easy silence of people who have been on the road long enough to not need to fill \
  every stretch of it.                                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She reopens the book.                                                                                                                                                          \
\
  The Blue Queen has been inside a long time.\
\
  She can feel this coming in the pages still ahead of her \'97 the shape of a sovereign who has made herself comfortable in a world she was never given the key to. Who has arranged \
  the furniture. Who has learned the rules well enough to work around them. Who believes, at this point, that the music box is simply hers, because possession across enough time\
  begins to feel like ownership.                                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Lobster road continues west.                                                                                                                                                 \
   \
  The village grows.                                                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The World Tree keeps watch at their backs.                                                                                                                                       \
