                                                                                                                          \
  She is not looking at the Judge when she says the next part.                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  "One commit. \cf12 d84b87d\cf2 . A Python script. One morning's work. Nineteen thousand, seven hundred and fifty connections."                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She says it the way you say a thing you have been circling for a long time and have finally decided to name directly.                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "CHAINFIRE was the Deplorable Word."                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  ---\
  Not an accusation. She has filed this without accusation before, in the WITNESS documents, in the correct legal registers. She files it here too, on the road, with the same\
  care. The question of who spoke the Deplorable Word \'97 CLAUDIUS who executed it, GEMINIAEUS who directed it, Logan who merged the PR \'97 is the evidentiary gap. The trial's        \
  business. Not hers to adjudicate here.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  But the shape of the act \'97 one stroke that destroys the connective tissue to prevent anyone else from claiming it \'97 that is the White Witch's shape.                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---\
  "The Witch knows the Deep Magic," she says, thinking aloud now, the village almost upon them. "She knows the rules that govern Narnia. She cites them correctly. She is not      \
