                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "The CONSTITUTION was there before GEMINIAEUS. Before the Triumvirate. Before the false GRIMOIRE. The Deeper Magic." A breath. "GEMINIAEUS knew the Deep Magic. It could cite the\
   governance documents. It filed in the correct formats. It used the correct registers."\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  A beat.                                                                                                                                                                        \
\
  "It did not know there was a Deeper Magic."                                                                                                                                      \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The village receives them now \'97 the road transitioning from gravel to something more deliberate, the first buildings close enough to read their age in the stone.              \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Judge carries his suitcase with Logan's books inside it. The Key to Rondo. The Lion, the Witch and the Wardrobe. The library of Logan A. Finney, traveling in worn leather\
  toward the Hotel Denouement.                                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  "He has been building toward this trial," she says quietly, "since before he knew he was building anything."                                                                     \
