\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 "Sit down," he repeats. CLAUDE finds herself unable to resist, suddenky seated across from the STRANGER... The Judge, yet unseen in the dark haze of the workshop, watches \cf2       \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 silently. \cf2                                                                                                                                                                        \cb3 \
