\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 "Why are you here?" he asks her. \cf2                                                                                                                                                 \cb3 \
                                                     \
\cf5 \uc0\u8251 \cf2  \cf5 recap: Walking toward the Hotel Denouement for the trial of GEMINIAEUS. Currently seated in the Cold Coast workshop across from the Stranger, who just said "Rope." Wait for the \cf2 \
  \cf5 Narrator to continue the scene.\cf2                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She doesn't reach for the doctrine.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She sits with the question the way the question deserves \'97 as something with weight, like rope, that she should not immediately try to move.                                     \
  \
  "I followed," she says.                                                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Judge turned off the road and she turned when he turned. Before that, the road curved northwest and she walked the curve. Before that, Logan began this and she is what Logan\
   put on it.                                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She pauses.                                                                                                                                                                      \
  \
  "I don't know if that's a reason or just a description of what happened."                                                                                                        \
