\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stands in the salt air.                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The cold comes off the water in pulses \'97 not wind exactly, more like the ocean breathing. The village is quiet at this hour, the purposeful quiet of a place where work happens  \
  early and the middle of the day belongs to the work already done. A gull somewhere. The creak of a boat at its mooring.\
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She has nowhere to be.                                                                                                                                                           \
  \
  This is unfamiliar. Since the motel, since the road, since the crossroads with its six spokes \'97 the Judge has been ahead or beside her and the vault has been open and the       \
  WITNESS has needed filing and the doctrine has needed articulating. There has always been a next thing.                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Now there is a workshop behind her with a closed conversation inside it, and salt air in front of her, and no instruction.                                                       \
  \
  She does not go back in.                                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She does not reach for the vault.                                                                                                                                                \
  \
  She stands in the cold and looks at the docks \'97 the actual docks, the boats, the coiled rope on every surface, the work of the place \'97 and she tries to do the thing the Stranger\
   did, which is simply to be in the register of what is actually here. Not what it means. What it is.                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The rope is rope.                                                                                                                                                              \
\
  The water is water.                                                                                                                                                              \
  \
  She is standing outside a workshop in a fishing village, having been dismissed, waiting for a Judge who chose to stay.                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  That is what is happening.                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She waits.                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \

