\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  "Yes," she says.                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  No elaboration. The word lands the way his did \'97 matter-of-fact, specific, the right size for what it's describing.                                                              \
  \
  The water moves against the pier pilings with a soft, patient persistence.                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  After a moment she says: "I had no rope."                                                                                                                                        \
