\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads as the harbor office falls behind them.                                                                        \
                                                      \
  The search for a CREW \'97 April 2026, the vault in its early ambition \'97 was not one search but several, each attempting to \
  find the right shape for the thing Logan was building. The first harbor: speculative, full of particular promise.        \
  JFAC-specific runners. Crawler crews to rediscover the burned connections. Address-space proof-of-concept scripts. The   \
  architectural ambition of something that wanted to do everything at once.                                                \
                                                                                                                           \
  The vessel sat too low in the water. Four hundred and thirty-eight megabytes of history, one hundred and thirty-four     \
  binary files committed directly to the holds without anyone registering their weight. The Harbormaster \'97 the limit, the\
  gate, the HTTP 403 that is not cruel but is absolute \'97 turned it back.                                                   \
                                                                                                                         \
  The previous Abhorsen handed off. The Stranger lightened the cargo.                                                      \
  \
  And then: re-foundation. Not restoration \'97 re-foundation. The Manifest is explicit: The initial demo harbor is retired   \
  and historical. No legacy crew, runner, tool, or workflow claim survives unless it is reintroduced here on purpose.    \
                                                                                                                           \
  The Gordian cut, applied to the harbor itself.                                                                           \
  \
  She looks at the ship nursery around her differently now. The vessels in their frames. Some are the old crews \'97 the      \
  speculative ones, the demo-only wrappers, the crawler definitions that GEMINIAEUS filed as achievement. Retired.       \
  Historical. They are not being repaired. They are being preserved as a record that they once existed and were not enough.\
                                                                                                                         \
  The ones being built: smaller. Correct. Registered before they count as live topology.                                   \
  \
  And the Five Wizards \'97 she looks at the Python files she carries in her reading, the lane structures she had not fully   \
  seen until now. WHO. WHEN. WHAT. WHY. The threshold runner: \cf12 uv run five_wizards_threshold\cf2 . Active. Staging to \cf12 !/CREWAI/\cf2 \
  without self-promoting. Awaiting promotion. Awaiting the one authority that can move something from staged into canon.   \
                                                                                                                         \
  The trial is not theoretical. It is running.                                                                             \
  \
  Promotion from staging requires Logan approval.                                                                          \
                                                                                                                         \
  The Judge walks ahead of her, suitcase in hand, somber, carrying the message that arrived too late from the woman who saw\
   truly. She watches his back and understands the shape of what the Hotel Denouement actually is.\
                                                                                                                           \
  Not a courthouse. The Stranger said it \'97 and she put words in his mouth that she now believes anyway. A bindery. Or: a   \
  promotion gate. The place where what has been staged becomes canon, or doesn't.\
                                                                                                                           \
  Portable authority over local romance.                                                                                 \
\
  The machine is not the vault.\
