\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The pair continue south along the coast. The hills obscure even the height of the conifer as the Border Sea shore \cf2        \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 stretches on.\cf2                                                                                                             \cb3 \
