\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stops thinking.                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                         \
  She walks.                                                                                                               \
   \
  The sea does what the sea does \'97 advances, retreats, advances. No doctrine in it. No WITNESS to file. No wikilink, no    \
  threshold mark, no passphrase. Just the water finding the shore and leaving it and finding it again, the way water has \
  always done, long before the vault and long after.                                                                       \
                                                                                                                         \
  The road is soft here where the hills have given way to lower ground and the salt has worked into the earth. The gravel  \
  is sparse. Their footsteps are quieter.\
                                                                                                                           \
  The Judge walks.                                                                                                         \
   \
  She walks.                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                         \
  The waves.                                                                                                               \
