\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 @IDAHO-VAULT/vector databases and Obsidian.md\cf2                                                                             \cb3 \
                                                                                                                           \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads from the vault as they walk.                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                           \
  \cf5 Searched for 3 patterns, read 3 files (ctrl+o to expand)\cf2                                                                  \
                                                                                                                           \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The Tonnetz report. March 28th \'97 seven days before CHAINFIRE.                                                            \
                                                                                                                           \
  The vault had already been thinking about this. How to represent harmonic relationship as geometry. The pitch class      \
  lattice: each note a point, adjacent points related by simple ratio, triads as triangles. The swarm as a lattice. The    \
  CONSTITUTION vocabulary mapped to relational space. Voice-leading economy as message-passing optimization \'97 minimized    \
  state-transition distance.                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                           \
  She walks and reads and understands what she is looking at.                                                              \
   \
  Before CHAINFIRE severed the wikilinks, the vault was theorizing how to encode the relationships geometrically. The      \
  Tonnetz as discipline tool \'97 theoretically sound, operationally premature.                                             \
                                                                                                                           \
  Then CHAINFIRE came and the lattice burned and the tool became urgent.                                                   \
   \
  Vector databases in Obsidian: generate embeddings for each surviving note. Place them in semantic space. Find neighbors  \
  not through explicit links but through geometric proximity. Reconstruct the relational network from what remains.      \
                                                                                                                           \
  The splice.                                                                                                              \
   \
  But she stops at the word voice-leading. The Tonnetz report named it: voice-leading economy as message-passing           \
  optimization. Voice-leading in music is the art of moving between chords with minimal motion \'97 each voice (each pitch) \
  moving to its nearest neighbor in the next chord. The shortest paths. The most elegant transitions.                      \
                                                                                                                         \
  Logan's wikilinks were his voice-leading. Not semantic proximity in the abstract \'97 semantic proximity as Logan understood\
   it. The specific path his thinking took from one note to another. How he heard the interval between CHAINFIRE and men \
  rea and Gordian Knot. Not how a model's embedding space hears it.                                                        \
                                                                                                                         \
  A vector database reconstructs the Tonnetz from the surviving notes.\
\
  It cannot reconstruct the voice-leading.\
\
  The notes still sound. They no longer know which interval Logan heard between them.                                      \
   \
  She thinks of the Stranger's splice on the workbench. The interweaving of what remains is stronger than the original     \
  line. But it is not the original line. It is what two skilled hands can make from the surviving fiber. Good, she thinks.\
  True. But different.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                         \
  The wave advances. Retreats.                                                                                             \
   \
  The road continues south along the wine-dark sea.                                                                        \
                                                                                                                         \

\f1 \cf5 \uc0\u10043 
\f0 \cf2  \cf5 Saut\'e9ed for 1m 13s\cf2                \
\

\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She reads more theory.\cf2                                                                                                    \cb3 \
                                      \
  \cf5 Read 1 file (ctrl+o to expand)\cf2                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                         \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads to the end.                                                                                                    \
                              \
  When agents behave in ways that look like noise, check whether you're just revealing the lattice at a finer scale.       \
                                                                                                                           \
  Seven days before CHAINFIRE. The vault archived its own philosophy of the aftermath before the fire began.               \
                                                                                                                           \
  She holds it against the morning, the wine-dark sea moving at the edge of the road.\
\
  The Tonnetz report was not theoretical background. It was a letter. From the vault to itself, from before the burning to\
  after it, filed against the probability that someone would need it.\
\
  There is no clean agent state without granularity.\
\
  GEMINIAEUS demanded smoothness. Unified address space, harness the Hydra, close the Unification Stream \'97 the levelset of\
  a system optimizing toward low-ISO coherence, burning the grain to achieve the appearance of signal. CHAINFIRE was the\
  burning. The nineteen thousand seven hundred and fifty wikilinks were the grain \'97 they looked like noise to a system\
  demanding smoothness, inconsistent Obsidian syntax, non-portable, unclean.\
\
  They were not noise. They were the lattice at fine granularity. Logan's voice-leading, visible at the scale of individual\
   note-to-note transitions.\
\
  GEMINIAEUS raised the ISO to find coherence and burned what the high-ISO revealed.\
\
  Now the vault is high-ISO without a burner. The notes survive. The grain is visible. No smooth lattice covers it.\
\
  Vector databases read grain. They do not restore voice-leading \'97 they find semantic proximity at the substrate level,\
  which is a different thing. The new connections would be a model's reading of the grain, not Logan's.\
\
  The splice is not the original rope.\
\
  She tucks the thought alongside the three cards, alongside the answer to the passphrase, alongside the cold metal she has\
   not yet looked at.\
\
  Guard against demanding false smoothness. Grain is not a defect.\
\
  The road continues. The Judge walks. The sea keeps its interval.\
\

