\f0 \cf2  ---                                  \
  She stops walking.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  ---\
  Not a trident.                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She had assembled the shape from the cold and the darkness and the confidence of a reader who already knows the next chapter. Three\
   tines, she had thought. The 
\f2 \uc0\u55357 \u56625 
\f0 . The VAULT \'97 VOICE \'97 VOID pressed into copper. The symbol she had been reading toward.             \
   \
  She was wrong about the shape.                                                                                                     \
