   built ice castles and kidnapped princesses and could not explain, even to himself, what he was looking for.\
\
  "Where is my princess?"\
\
  He was looking for Betty. He was looking for himself. The crown had taken the original and left behind a being of great power and\
  entirely lost purpose \'97 still searching for the thing the power was supposed to protect, unable to remember what it was.\
\
  Gemini named this: The tragedy of the Voice (The Crown) is that it builds the Vault but creates the Void of the self.\
\
