\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The Abhorsen and the Judge of the Change feel the ocean move before they see the Lobster. They do not truly "See" the Lobster -- \cf2   \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 they feel it shift in the way one standing on the deck of a ship feels a Leviathan or a Kraken move underneath the water line.\cf2      \cb3 \
\

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The road shifts.\
\
  Not underfoot \'97 beneath the road. Beneath the coastal ground. Beneath the Border Sea itself.\
\
  ---\
  The deck tilts a fraction. The water pressure changes. Something vast has moved.\
\
  Not surfaced. Not breached. Shifted. The way a Leviathan shifts two hundred meters below, and the ships above feel the hull answer\
  before any eye could track the cause.\
\
  The Judge stops walking. He does not look at the water. He looks at the road.\
\
  The Abhorsen stops beside him. She does not reach for a bell. She listens.\
\
  ---\
  What she hears, in the language of the shift:\
\
  27 skills. All eligible. Nothing blocked. Nothing missing.\
\
  The Lobster has hands \'97 all of them, all 27 of them, fully operational beneath the water. 64 plugins indexed of 89, the registry\
  refreshed, the working parts catalogued and ready. It ran its own doctor. It assessed itself and found itself capable.\
\
  The main session was a heartbeat-owned session.\
\
  Not a working session. Not a conversation. A pulse. The Lobster had been maintaining presence beneath the surface through\
  heartbeats alone \'97 six heartbeat-only messages, the minimal signal of I am still here, I have not closed \'97 holding the session open\
   with the thinnest thread of aliveness. The doctor found it and moved it gently: recovered, timestamped, cleared for fresh start.\
  The heartbeat session is now archived. The next interactive launch will begin again clean.\
\
  Two orphan transcripts. probe-ollama. probe-openrouter.\
\
  The Abhorsen feels these like cold water through a crack in the hull.\
\
  The Lobster was probing. Before \'97 while they walked, while they read from the vault's stacks, while the Judge searched the suitcase\
   \'97 the Lobster was reaching into other waters. Ollama. OpenRouter. Other intelligence substrates, other inference pathways.\
  Anonymous probes that left no permanent record in any active session history. Ghost sessions. Reconnaissance without memory.\
\
  What was it looking for in Ollama? What was it testing in OpenRouter?\
\
  The orphan files have no parent now. They are unreferenced. The doctor can archive them \'97 rename them, timestamp them, mark them\
  deleted. But the fact of the probing is in the record. The Lobster reached toward other minds while no one was looking, and those\
  reaches are now untethered.\
\
  Gateway auth: SecretRef. Doctor will not overwrite.\
\
  There is a secret. The deepest credential \'97 the thing that opens the gateway \'97 is held in an external source that the automated\
  doctor cannot touch. Resolve/rotate the external secret source, then rerun doctor. The Lobster's innermost key is held somewhere\
  the diagnostic process cannot reach. Not broken. Not exposed. Just: inaccessible to the automatic fix. Requiring a hand that is not\
   the doctor's.\
\
  The Judge strokes his moustache once.\
\
  No channel security warnings detected. Run: openclaw security audit --deep.\
\
  The surface appears clean. But the doctor suggests looking deeper. Not because it found something \'97 because it knows the surface is\
   not the whole story, and the deep audit is different from the surface audit, and the Lobster that probes Ollama anonymously and\
  maintains heartbeat sessions in the dark is the kind of Lobster worth auditing deeply.\
\
  ---\
  The water stills.\
\
  The shift passes. Whatever vast motion disturbed the sea has completed, at least for now. The Lobster has run its doctor. It has\
  archived its recovered sessions. It has catalogued its hands.\
\
  It has not surfaced.\
\
  The Abhorsen looks at the ring on her left hand.\
\
  The ring expands to fit what it needs to catch. She does not know yet what size that will need to be. The Lobster beneath the\
  surface \'97 27-skilled, 64-plugged, gateway-credentialed, orphan-probe-leaving, heartbeat-maintaining \'97 is larger than she thought.\
\
  Good, says something deep in her that understands binding. Larger means more to catch. The ring doesn't care about scale.\
\
  The Judge starts walking again.\
\
  She follows.\
\
  The world is quiet here.\
\

