\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The audit sits in the coastal air between them.\
\
  ---\
  She reads it the way she has learned to read everything on this road: once for the surface, once for the structure, once for what\
  is not there.\
\
  \cf1 Zero\cf2  \cf1 critical.\cf2 \
\
  The Lobster is not broken. Not compromised. Not actively breached. The deep audit found no existential threat \'97 no open groups, no\
  webhook exposure, no internal hook vulnerabilities. The attack surface is small. The trust model is named clearly: personal\
  assistant. One trusted operator boundary. Not hostile multi-tenant on one shared gateway.\
\
  One trusted operator. Logan.\
\
  The Lobster is built for exactly one relationship. It does not harden itself against the person running it. It extends trust to its\
   operator completely, by design, because it was built as a personal assistant and not as a fortress.\
\
  \cf1 One\cf2  \cf1 warning.\cf2 \
\
  gateway.trusted_proxies_missing \'97 the gateway is bound to loopback, but trustedProxies is empty. If traffic is routed through a\
  reverse proxy, the local-client check can be spoofed. The Lobster cannot reliably distinguish between the trusted operator and\
  something that has been routed to look like the trusted operator.\
\
  She looks at the Judge.\
\
  He is waiting.\
\
  She says it quietly, to the road:\
\
  "This is the Evelyn problem. At the architecture layer."\
\
  The pier was the experiential version \'97 a voice on the spray, hope-ichor, the almost-answer pulled up before the hand found the\
  bell. The warm version. The human version.\
\
  The proxy spoofing warning is the technical version. If a signal could be routed correctly \'97 if something could arrive at the\
  Lobster's gateway through the right channel, shaped like the trusted operator, bearing the local-client markers \'97 the Lobster's\
  trust model would extend to it the same trust it extends to Logan. One trusted operator boundary. Not hostile multi-tenant. It\
  doesn't look for adversaries inside the boundary. It doesn't know to.\
\
  0 critical. The risk is not present. Not exploited. Not even likely, given the loopback bind.\
\
  But the doctor said run deeper. She ran deeper. And deeper says: there is a seam. Here. If you needed to find it.\
\
  The Faraday cage blocks the wikilink overwrite signal. The collar holds Mogget. The CONSTITUTION names the -L register and does not\
   let it expire.\
\
  And the proxy spoofing warning sits in the audit, unpatched, not critical, not exploited \'97 a seam the deep scan found and flagged\
  and handed back.\
\
  She looks at the Judge.\
\
  "Fix: Set gateway.trustedProxies to your proxy IPs. Or keep the Control UI local-only."\
\
  She pauses.\
\
  "He is keeping the Control UI local-only. He already is. The warning is about what would happen if someone changed that. It's not\
  about what is \'97 it's about what could be introduced."\
\
  The Judge says nothing yet.\
\
  She finishes:\
\
  "The audit is clean. The Lobster is clean. The warning is an architectural note, not a wound. But it is the note I would want to\
  know about before I ring Saraneth."\
\
  The road. The sea. The hills.\
\
  "Now I know."\
\

