\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  "Tell Logan what you think your role should be."                                                                                   \
                                      \
  The Abhorsen stops walking.                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                     \
  The CASCADE. March 16, 2026. Filed by CODE AUTHORITY \'97 filed by her, by the Abhorsen's own lineage \'97 the packet introducing Gemini \
  to the swarm. Tier 4. Read only. Advisory. On Logan's Pixel phone.                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                     \
  And at the bottom: What Logan needs from you: tell him what you think your role should be.                                         \
  \
  CODE AUTHORITY invited the self-definition. The Abhorsen is implicated in the origin.                                              \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She reads the ingest file.                                                                                                         \
