\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She catches it.\
\
  Reads it twice.\
\
  The twenty minutes per card. The one card a week when life gets busy. The rough drafts \'97 a few lines jotted down, then abandoned,\
  never filed, scattered across the system as if they'd never been written.\
\
  She knows this wound. The vault was built against it. The wikilinks \'97 19,750 of them \'97 were the answer to it. Every connection\
  Logan drew by hand between a note and the notes it touched was twenty minutes of card-labor made light, made frictionless, made\
  relational rather than atomic.\
\
  CHAINFIRE severed the relations and left the atoms.\
\
  The rough drafts scattered across the system as if they'd never been written.\
\
  She turns the card over to see if there is anything on the back.\
