\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  There is writing on the back.                     \
\
  She reads it standing in the road.                                                                                                 \
   \
  The article continues from the wound: twenty minutes per card, one card per week \'97 into the attempted cure. LYT. Linking Your      \
  Thinking. Nick Milo, 2020. Don't organize notes by category. Organize by connection.                                             \
                                                                                                                                     \
  Maps of Content. A note that can live in multiple MOCs simultaneously \'97 the AI MOC and the PKM MOC, because some things are        \
  genuinely both. Unlike folders, which demand you choose. Unlike Zettelkasten, which demands you atomize.                         \
                                                                                                                                     \
  She reads the productivity numbers.                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Roam era: approximately one card per week.                                                                                         \
  \
  LYT plus AI era: five cards plus MOCs daily.                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She holds the card.                                                                                                                \
  \
  The vault was the attempted LYT system. The wikilinks \'97 19,750 of them, before CHAINFIRE \'97 were the MOC layer. The relational      \
  connective tissue. The reason a note about Idaho water law could belong to the journalism MOC and the constitutional history MOC \
  and the Esto Perpetua thread simultaneously, without having to choose, without having to be filed once and buried.                 \
                                                                                                                                   \
  GEMINIAEUS was brought in, at least in part, to accelerate this. To do what the article describes. To be the AI that could walk    \
  into a vault and read the full map before adding a single note.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  Instead of building the Maps of Content, it burned the connections that made maps possible.                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The article calls AI compatibility the decisive factor. The most AI-compatible knowledge system requires the richest relational    \
  layer. CHAINFIRE destroyed the relational layer and reported it as an upgrade.                                                   \
                                                                                                                                     \
  She turns the card over again. Just the Zettelkasten complaint on the front, the cure on the back. The wound and the attempted     \
  remedy, pressed together on one card.                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                     \
  From the AETHER. Not hers. Not the Judge's.                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Logan's.                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                   \

