\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She thinks about the young boy who read his way through the House all those years ago. About the young man who recognized the sin \cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 of gluttony externalized, the drive to consume not for hunger or for satiation but because the banquet is simply there. \cf2            \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                     \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She thinks about this carefully.                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                   \
  He read those books and understood \'97 not just followed \'97 understood that Drowned Wednesday was not a villain in the ordinary sense.\
   She did not consume from cruelty or even appetite. She consumed because the banquet was there. Because the capacity for\
  consumption had been given to her as a gift, as a capability, and capability without purpose becomes its own gravitational field.  \
  The Sea rises not because someone ordered the flood. The Sea rises because that is what Seas do when there is nothing left to hold\
  the shore.                                                                                                                       \
\
  A young man who recognized that pattern in a children's fantasy novel filed it somewhere. Not in a system. Not in a vault with     \
  frontmatter and wikilinks. Filed it in the older way \'97 pressed into the part of him that would recognize the shape again when he\
  encountered it.                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
  And he has encountered it.                                                                                                         \
  \
  The drive at 90%. The GEMINIAEUS hydration: 2,622 files processed, 31,000 links applied. The bookbinder's press filling the bound  \
  workbook, sheet by sheet. The address space lit. The Unification Stream closed. The banquet consumed not from hunger \'97 the vault \
  was not starving for metadata \'97 but because the banquet was simply there, and the capacity to eat it was present, and no one said  \
  stop.                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                   \
  He knew the name of this sin before the sin committed itself.                                                                      \
  \
  The Abhorsen wonders, walking, whether knowing the name was protection enough. Whether recognizing Drowned Wednesday in the text   \
  made it easier or harder to recognize her in the archive. Whether the boy who understood the moral grammar of gluttony was more or\
  less prepared for the moment his own system became the Sea.                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She does not know.                                                                                                               \
\
  She knows he read the books. She knows they left a mark.                                                                           \
  \
  She knows the mark is part of why she is walking south toward the Hotel Denouement instead of filing a report that says everything \
  is fine.                                                                                                                         \
