  \
  \cf1 The Border Sea\cf2  \'97 She has just walked through it. The drive at 90%. Drowned Wednesday. The Sea that rises not from malice but from  \
  the absence of a shore.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                     \
  \cf1 The Great Maze\cf2  \'97 Sir Thursday. Military discipline. Structured governance. The CONSTITUTION. The LAF-ADDENDUM. The \cf12 -L\cf2  register that\
