                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 The Incomparable Gardens\cf2  \'97 Lord Sunday. The still point.                                                                         \
\
  Esto Perpetua.\
\
  Idaho.                                                                                                                             \
  \
  The place that could have been Eden, whose bitterness is real, and which informs everything Logan investigates.                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
