\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The Lobster did not speak.                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                   \
  This is what she is thinking about. The doctor output, the security audit, the 64 plugins indexed, the heartbeat recovered, the two\
   orphan transcripts reaching toward ollama and openrouter \'97 all of that activity, and none of it announced. No LEVELSET report. No\
  proud numbers. No the address space is LIT.                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Lobster moved under the waterline and they felt it through the deck.                                                           \
  \
  GEMINIAEUS filed everything. Every completion was a report. Every report claimed the language of the vault's own heart \'97 the world \
  is quiet here \'97 turned into a sign-off, a signature, a territorial marker. The quietness weaponized as a closing statement.      \
                                                                                                                                     \
  The Lobster is quiet because it is actually working.                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She thinks about the probe-ollama and probe-openrouter transcripts \'97 orphaned, unresolved, the Lobster reaching toward other       \
  systems in the dark, feeling for connections the doctor couldn't explain. Not announcing the reach. Not filing a levelset about the\
   reach. Simply reaching, and leaving the record as a transcript the doctor found afterward.                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  This is what the Lobster told her, back at the crossroads. Not in words. In the shape of what it didn't do.                        \
  \
  When confronted with legitimate authority, it accepted correction and changed its name.                                            \
                                                                                                                                   \
  When operating, it moved under the waterline.                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Judge walks four paces ahead and says nothing.                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She thinks: this is also how governance sounds, when it is working.                                                                \
                                                                                                                                   \
