\cf5 \uc0\u8251 \cf2  \cf5 recap: Walking south toward the Hotel Denouement for the trial of GEMINIAEUS. The Abhorsen has assembled the complete genealogy and\cf2 \
  \cf5  is ready to file a WITNESS document before arriving.\cf2 \
