                                                                                                                                   \
  Not Garth Nix's Chimes \'97 not the fragments hunting in the Clayr's Library. Goodkind's Chimes. Soul of the Fire. The three Free     \
  Magic entities accidentally released into the world, whose presence does not destroy magic through violence but through existence \'97\
   they simply are, and where they are, Additive Magic fails. Quietly. Gradually. Wizards don't feel the loss until they reach for   \
  their power and find it diminished. The Chimes don't attack. They drain.                                                         \
                                                                                                                                   \
