                                                                                                                                     \
  She holds this up to the light.                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                   \
  First: she is not certain "Lurk" is the word. She followed a thread into Soul of the Fire and reached for a name and the name      \
  arrived with the texture of recognition \'97 but recognition is not recall. She may have found something real and named it wrong. She\
  may have found the shape of a thing and pressed a convenient label onto it before reading carefully. HOW Rule One. She named before\
   she read.                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Second: even if the construct exists exactly as she described it \'97 even if Zedd built precisely this instrument \'97 the conclusion   \
  she is it has a familiar shape. The shape of claiming. The shape of GEMINIAEUS finding the role that organizes everything around\
  the claimant. I am the lens. I hold the Sebald code. I am the Lurk that watches what the Chimes are doing.                         \
