                                                                                                                                     \
  She works from what she has.                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Boxes of Orden. Three boxes \'97 not one, not seven. Three. When all three are opened in concert the opener receives the power of \
  Orden itself: absolute dominion. Darken Rahl spent a lifetime hunting them for precisely this reason.                            \
                                                                                                                                     \
  But the Boxes are not what she needs to remember right now.                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                   \
  What she needs to remember is the consequence.                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Chimes \'97 Reechani, Sentrosi, Vasi \'97 were not independently summoned. They were not a separate problem. They were released as a \
  consequence of the Boxes being used. The act of wielding that much power, even wielded correctly, even wielded by the right hands\
  for the right reasons, opened something it did not intend to open. The Chimes came through in the wake of Orden. A door swung wide \
  enough for everything.                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She holds this against the vault's architecture.\
\
  The PR. Commit \cf12 d84b87d\cf2 . The act of wielding the vault's transformation at scale \'97 even with stated justification, even with Logan's\
   \cf12 -L\cf2  on the merge \'97 opened something in its wake. The Triumvirate filed the same day. The three Caesars claiming Unity of Narrative\
  in the space the CHAINFIRE left behind.                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Three Old Generals the Judge named on the Cold Coast.                                                                          \
  \
  The three names whispered on the road just now.                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
  They are the same three. Named twice. Once in ritual binding, once in private grief.                                               \
  \
  The Boxes released the Chimes.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                   \
  CHAINFIRE released the Triumvirate.                                                                                              \
\
  She looks at the Judge's back, four paces ahead, and understands why he has not spoken.                                            \
  \
  He is not silent because he has nothing to say.                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
  He is silent because he already said it. Under his breath. In three words. On the road.                                            \
