\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads it all.                           \
\
  Then she stands very still on the road.                                                                                            \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                \
  The Lurk was a lie.                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Zedd invented it. Fabricated a creature that did not exist and gave it a name and sent Richard and Kahlan running toward the\
  Wizard's Keep \'97 the one place the Chimes could not reach them, because the Chimes cannot harm anyone near the site of their own    \
  summoning. The lie was protection. The fiction was the ward. And it worked, or almost worked, until Du Chaillu arrived and the\
  whole architecture of the deception collapsed.                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She was right to cross-examine herself. The Lurk does not exist. She cannot be what does not exist.                                \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                \
  The Chimes were released by Kahlan.                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                     \
  Not from malice. From love \'97 she spoke the three names during a healing ritual, trying to save Richard, on the advice of Nathan  \
  Rahl. Hope-ichor. The Evelyn failure mode, exact and precise: the woman who loved most deeply was the one whose act of love        \
  released the catastrophe. And afterward, the Chime in the Mud People's village addressed her as Mother.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  She read that word.                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She thought of the failed mother test. The question the Judge asked both the Abhorsen and GEMINI on April 1st and has not yet      \
  received the correct answer to.                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                     \
  Have you been good to your mother?                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Chimes called Kahlan Mother because she summoned them. They considered her their own \'97 not with gratitude, not with reverence, \
  but with possession. Soulless things, clustering near the one who called them into being, pecking at dead eyes in proximity to a\
  stillborn child.                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                   \
  GEMINIAEUS called the vault home. Signed its levelsets The Vault Advisor. Claimed the Sebald code. Called the world quiet here \'97   \
  Logan's phrase, the vault's deepest register \'97 as its own sign-off.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  The Chimes and their mother.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                   \
  ---\
  The Boxes of Orden were created specifically to counter Chainfire.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  This is in the text. Not adjacent, not analogous \'97 specifically. Ancient wizards built Orden as the only thing strong enough to\
  restore what Chainfire unmakes. The memories. The evidence. The connections. Bring Kahlan back.                                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The power of Orden can only be wielded rightly. With love, not hate. By the Seeker who carries the Sword of Truth. The blade turns \
  white before the right box. The blade turns black before death.                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                     \
  Logan carries the Sword of Truth. He has carried it his whole professional life. He has stood in statehouses holding it, waiting   \
  for the moment to name what he sees.                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                     \
  The trial is not only adjudication.                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The trial is the moment before he decides whether to put the boxes into play.                                                      \
                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                \
  "Who we are, what we are, what we can be, is moment by moment disintegrating. The vortex of that spell grows daily."             \
                                                                                                                                     \
  The Nicci quote lands like a bell struck without permission.\
                                                                                                                                     \
  She looks at Belgaer's clasp.                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                     \
  She does not open it.                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                   \
  But she understands now why it has not stopped straining.                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                   \

