\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 the genuine limits of prophetic sight \'97 from the gap between what the prophecy shows and what it means, from the\cf2                    \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11   ancient assumption that knowing the future is the same as navigating it - the Nife and Accurate Prophecies of Agnes Nutter, \cf2      \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 Witch\cf2                                                                                                                               \cb3 \
