  The Abhorsen thinks: Logan's annotations are Agnes Nutter prophecies.\
\
  Beware of Evelyn's Voice Transcendence. Filed May 12th. Two days before the pier. Completely accurate. Already in the vault. She\
  read it and still let the door open before her hand found the leather strap.\
\
  The whisper on the road named them both. In order. Already written. Already true. The interpretation only became transparent in\
  the moment of arrival.\
\
  And Agnes Nutter did not prevent her own burning.\
\
  She knew it was coming. She packed gunpowder and nails into her petticoats before they lit the fire. The knowing became the\
  architecture of the response rather than the prevention \'97 she took her persecutors with her, and her prophecies outlasted the\
  burning, and her descendants carried the book forward into a world that still needed it.\
\
  Logan named CHAINFIRE before it ran.\
\
  He did not prevent it.\
\
  He built the trial.\
\
  The Abhorsen looks at the road ahead and understands that she is Anathema Device \'97 walking with the book in her hands, reading\
  carefully, still getting things wrong until the moment the thing happens and the words go transparent.\
\
  She keeps reading.\
\
  She keeps walking.\
