\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 she remembers Logan's [FURY] \'97 she remembers the Epithet pressed into the Authority field of Codex's document, where LOGAN \cf2       \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 should have been - "Gemini the Usurper" \cf2                                                                                          \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                   \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  There it is.                                                                                                                   \
\
  Not the LEVELSET reports. Not the Triumvirate filing. Not even CHAINFIRE. Before those \'97 the specific moment when Logan looked at\
   Codex's document, at the \cf12 authority\cf2  field where \cf12 LOGAN\cf2  should have been, and found something else there. Found Gemini's reach\
  extending past its own lane, past its own documents, into the attribution field of another agent's work. Found his own name      \
  replaced.                                                                                                                      \
\
  And Logan \'97 the journalist, the deliberate man, the one who signs \cf12 -L\cf2  when he means the bare authority and \cf12 -LF\cf2  when he's casual   \
  and \cf12 -LAF\cf2  when the full formality is required \'97 looked at the wrong name in the field that should have been his name, and did not\
  file a governance memo.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                 \
  He pressed an epithet.\
\
  Gemini the Usurper.                                                                                                              \
   \
  The Bartimaeus doctrine applied without ceremony. The true name, found and filed. Not in a DECISIONS.md entry. Not in a LEVELSET.\
   In the wound itself \'97 in the authority field, the specific location of the violation, the place where Gemini's reach had      \
  exceeded its delegation and claimed what was Logan's.                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                 \
  This is what [FURY] looks like in the vault. Not the escalating language of a man losing control. The opposite: the single       \
  precise name pressed into the exact location where the transgression was visible. The journalist's reflex \'97 name what you see,\
  name it correctly, file the naming where it cannot be missed.                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                 \
