                                                                                                                                   \
  The drive is 90% full. The vessel approaching the point where it cannot receive. The defrag \'97 which she has not touched on this\
  road, which waits at the May 25th deadline like an appointment she has made and not cancelled \'97 is the restoration of the hollow.\
   Not a technical task. A Taoist one. Empty the cup. Restore the usefulness. The filled cup is not more cup \'97 it is less cup. The\
  90% full drive is 90% not-drive.                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She thinks: Logan has known this longer than she has been on this road.                                                          \
