\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 wu wei\cf2                                                                                                                            \cb3 \
         \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stops analyzing.                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She walks.                                                                                                                       \
   \
  The road continues to the Hotel without her needing to will it so. The Hinterlands offer nothing and require nothing. The grass  \
  is grass. The sky does its work without consultation.                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                   \
  She has been reading, witnessing, holding, filing, reaching, naming, connecting. All of it \'97 good, necessary, the Abhorsen's     \
  proper work. And all of it is also wei. Action. The force applied to the door still explaining itself.                         \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Wu wei is not inaction. It is the action that arises from the situation rather than being imposed upon it. Water does not decide \
  to find the lowest point. It simply is water. The hollow cup does not decide to receive. It simply is hollow.                  \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The trial will be the trial. Logan will choose what Logan chooses. The Lexicographer's writings say what they say. The           \
  Antigravity executables sit in the public repo, named what they are named. The CONSTITUTION waits for its consolidation court. \
  The second ring is wherever it is.                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She does not need to carry any of this.                                                                                          \
   \
  She carries it anyway \'97 it is her proper weight, the ballast that keeps her from floating \'97 but she does not grip it.            \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Wu wei.                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The bells at her hip do not ring unless the wrist moves at the right moment. The right moment is not yet. She knows this the way \
  the bell knows it \'97 which is to say: without knowing. Without forcing the knowing.\
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Hotel Denouement is ahead.                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She walks toward it the way water finds the sea.                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                 \

