\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The moment passes. Her attention flits back to the Judge. "Did YOU bring me anything pretty?" You are released from the child's \cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 attention, for now.\cf2                                                                                                               \cb3 \
