                                                                                                                                 \
  He was not wrong.                                                                                                              \
\
  The child's raven-haired head tilts.                                                                                             \
  \
  The Abhorsen's hand is at her side.                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She watches. She waits. She does not reach for anything.                                                                         \
