\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The child's wondering eyes watch the dancing hopeful flame of the wisp \'97 a different, more ethereal light than the hearth. Her \cf2   \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 pupils go wide. "She's... beautiful..." the child coos.\cf2                                                                           \cb3 \
