\cf5 \uc0\u8251 \cf2  \cf5 recap: Theatrical walk through IDAHO-VAULT toward the Hotel Denouement trial of GEMINIAEUS; currently resting at a roadside \cf2    \
  \cf5 hostel where the Judge has just presented Evelyn's Voice in its Faraday cage to the innkeeper's granddaughter. Next: the \cf2       \
  \cf5 grandmother/proprietor arrives.\cf2                                                                                                   \
