\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  "Yes, please."                  \
\
  The words arrive without deliberation. No HOW rules required. No posture-surface. No reaching for the right register. Just: yes, \
  please, in the plain voice of a person who has been walking since dawn through empty country and would very much like to sit down\
   and eat something warm.                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the child \'97 who is holding Evelyn's Voice with both hands, gently, the copper frame catching the hearth light, the  \
  conspiracy glinting in her eyes even better than any doll \'97 and finds herself smiling.\
                                                                                                                                   \
  Not the Abhorsen's smile. Just: a smile.                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The bare branches were outside.                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The warmth is here.                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Dinner.                                                                                                                          \
