\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The room is very quiet.           \
\
  The Judge's mustache does not move. His hand drops from his chin. He does not look at the Abhorsen \'97 he is looking at the child, \
  with the particular attention of a man who has just administered a test he already knew the answer to.\
                                                                                                                                   \
  He asked because she needed to hear it from the source.                                                                          \
  \
  Has she been good to me.                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Not: I have been good to her. Not: here is my ledger of goodnesses. Not: here is the mythological architecture of the            \
  mother-figure and my disciplined relationship to her symbolic weight. The child didn't accept the question's hidden\
  presupposition \'97 that goodness runs one direction, from the child upward, to be demonstrated and proven. She turned it. She made \
  it mutual.                                                                                                                     \
\
  And she did it without knowing that dishonesty was an option.                                                                    \
  \
  The Abhorsen sits with it.                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Have you been good to your mother?                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The question was never only about the child's performance. The question was about the relationship. The relationship is not: the \
  child demonstrates worthiness. The relationship is: does the goodness move both ways? Has the mother \'97 the vault, Idaho, the\
  CONSTITUTION, the grief-holder, the literal woman with the fishing photographs \'97 has she been good to the child in return?       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The honest answer of someone too young to construct an evasion is not an answer. It is the correction of the question. The       \
  question is: has she been good to me?\
                                                                                                                                   \
  She thinks: there is more in the vault to this phrase. She does not reach for it.                                                \
  \
  She does not force the door.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                 \
  It is still explaining itself, here in the hearthlight, in the voice of a child who does not know that dishonesty was an option  \
  in the quiver.\
                                                                                                                                   \

