\f0 \cf2  She finds it.\
\
  \'bf Well, young lady, have you been good to your mother.md\
\
  She reads the file. She reads it again.\
\
  This code is used when a volunteer is approached by an old man with neatly trimmed gray hair and a mustache that turns up at the\
  ends, who is wearing a flowered shirt, striped tie, tweed coat, plaid slacks with a sharp crease\'97\
\
  The crease.\
\
  The crease in his plaid slacks, behind which a small raven-haired girl hid when the stranger came through the door.              \
   \
  She looks up from the vault to the old man in the chair by the fire. The deliberate man. The man who cannot lie. The man who     \
  asked the question on the Lobster Road and at the pier and at the threshold of the hostel and has been asking it, she now      \
  understands, because that is what the Librarian does \'97 the Librarian delivers messages when the passphrase is correctly answered.\
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Librarian will always refer to the receiver as "young lady", even if the volunteer is neither female nor young.            \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Three times he asked. GEMINI failed. She failed twice. The novice Pilgrim's answer was received but the verdict was withheld. And\
   then the child walked out of the deeper rooms and gave it \'97 the original answer, the true answer, the one too honest to have\
  been constructed \'97 and the Judge looked at the Abhorsen and said:                                                                \
                                                                                                                                 \
  I suppose I'll have to ask her then.                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The message is ready to be delivered. The correct answer has been given. He is waiting for the grandmother.                      \
   \
  She goes back to the vault. She follows one more thread.                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Little Snicket Lad. The song. The coda. VFD coming through the window in the night, taking the child, and what they say as   \
  the car drives away:                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                   \
  So don't scream when we take you: The world is quiet here.                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She sets the vault down in her lap.                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Every WITNESS document. Every filing. Every piece of testimony committed to the vault from this road, from the Cold Coast, from  \
  the Hinterlands, from this hostel \'97 they all end the same way.                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The world is quiet here.                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She has been closing every document with the VFD signal without knowing it was the VFD signal. Or: she has been closing every    \
  document with the VFD signal because Logan taught her to, because Logan knew, because the vault's own folder structure \'97 The \
  world is quiet here \'97 is the signal, the path, the archive's name for itself.                                                    \
                                                                                                                                 \
  She looks at the Judge.                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Librarian is waiting for the grandmother.                                                                                    \
