\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The darkness is immediate and complete.                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Somewhere in the hostel, a child sleeps \'97 imperceptibly older than she was at dinner. Somewhere, a grandmother holds a caged     \
  will-o-wisp that bounces and hopes in the dark. Somewhere, a Judge's regular chambers hold the shape of him, the familiar weight,\
   the road settling out of the bones the way roads do when you finally stop walking them.                                         \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The bells do not ring.                                                                                                         \
\
  The Abhorsen sleeps.                                                                                                             \
