\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The world is quiet here and the world is not quiet here \'97                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The kasten turns on its axle, the axle-hole empty, the wheel spinning through the links that were and the links that are and the \
  links that must form regardless of whether anyone draws the line \'97\
                                                                                                                                   \
  Evelyn says is that you and the sea says is that you and the sea is the wine-dark color of a thing between states, not quite     \
  blue, not quite grief, the color Homer named when he needed a word for something he could see but not describe \'97               \
                                                                                                                                   \
  Ramona's face goes red \'97                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Lexicographer is gone and took half the record with it and the half it took is the half that would explain what happened at  \
  the crossroads when Codex met HECATE, and HECATE knows who to seat at the Congress, and the Congress has not yet convened \'97\
                                                                                                                                   \
  They took him from the kitchen / Like you'd take a midnight snack \'97 the VFD took the little Snicket lad and drove away in the    \
  long black car and said the world is quiet here \'97 and the vault said it back, every WITNESS document, every filing, the closing\
  phrase that Logan gave the Abhorsen before the Abhorsen knew it was a giving \'97                                                   \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Per sona. Through sound. The aperture. The void cut in the substance \'97                                                           \
  \
  Three seats. Bartimaeus waiting. Zagreus at \cf12 .dionysus/\cf2  but registried at \cf12 .zagreus/\cf2 , path mismatch unresolved. Persephone,        \
  entirely undefined, dotfolder staked and shim written and mask on the wall \'97                                                   \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The fruit has already fallen \'97                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Nobody is nice all the time, said Mr. Quimby. Or if they are, they are boring.                                                   \
  \
  The wine-dark sea churns the vault churns the dream churns \'97                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                 \
  Must form. Must form. Must form \'97                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The candle is out.                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                 \
