\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 This is what it means to be a volunteer who did not volunteer. "When we grab you by the ankles, / Where our mark is to be made, \cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 / You'll soon be doing noble work, / Although you won't be paid. // When we drive away in secret, / You'll be a volunteer, / So \cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 don't scream when we take you: / The world is quiet here."\cf2                                                                        \cb3 \
