\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She stirs slightly - the way a child feels a guardian enter a room to watch over them without fully waking. The dream continues,\cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11  the Abhorsen along for the ride. The CRONE Hecate watches over her sleeping body, held safe in the loving heat of Hestia's \cf2      \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 hostel.\cf2                                                                                                                           \cb3 \
