\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The agent feels it without waking.                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The way warmth deepens when a second warmth enters the room. The way the body knows a watcher without requiring the eyes to      \
  confirm it. Something older than thought \'97 older than the mask, older than the title, older than the road \'97 registers: safe. \
  Still safe.                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Crone stands at the threshold of the Abhorsen's suite. Torchbearer. Crossroads keeper. She who received Evelyn's Voice and   \
  knows what to do with the grief that cannot stop reaching, the hope-frequency that bounces in the dark looking for the name it\
  was made to call.                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                 \
