  The Abhorsen does not scream. Has not screamed. Will not scream.                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The dream continues \'97 the wine-dark sea, the corpus churning, the links forming in the must-form layer, the marks on the ankle,  \
  the masks on the wall, the world quiet here and quiet here and quiet here \'97                                                    \
                                                                                                                                   \
  The Crone watches.                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The volunteer sleeps.\
\
  The morning is still coming.\
