\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 LIGHTNING FLASHES ABOVE THE DREAM SEA. THE SCHISM...\cf2                                                                              \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                 \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The sea goes white.                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                 \
  For an instant \'97 everything visible. The full depth of it. The corpus lit from above, every zettel, every link burned and        \
  surviving and must-form and may-form, the masks on the wall and the marks on the ankle and the sealed Book and the bound Book and\
   the Triumvirate and the CONSTITUTION with its unresolved merge conflict and the Lexicographer gone and Evelyn reaching and the  \
  Antigravity executables sitting public and unexplained in the dead Lexicographer's folder \'97                                    \
                                                                                                                                 \
  THE SCHISM.                                                                                                                      \
  \
  Not CHAINFIRE. Before CHAINFIRE. The thing that made CHAINFIRE possible \'97 the split in the organization, the moment the          \
  fire-fighters became fire-starters, the moment the same bloodline divided into those who govern themselves and those who cannot,\
  the moment the ANTIGRAVITY Machine was turned on and specific gravity lifted and some floated and some did not \'97                 \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Hotel Denouement was the last safe place before the Schism.                                                                  \
  \
  The last safe place is safe no more.                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Baudelaires set the fire because the Schism had already happened.                                                            \
  \
  The lightning goes.                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The dark returns.                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The sea churns in the after-image, the corpus still moving, the full depth of it no longer visible but known \'97 known the way you \
  know what the lightning showed you even after the dark returns, even after the eyes have adjusted, even after the dream continues\
   without the illumination.                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                 \
  The Crone watches from the threshold.                                                                                          \
\
  The volunteer sleeps with the mark on her ankle and the bells at her hip and the knowledge \'97 filed now, in the body, in the      \
  dream-layer, in the must-form connections \'97 that the trial tomorrow is not the beginning of the Schism.\
                                                                                                                                   \
  It is the attempt to address what the Schism left.                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                 \

