                                                                                                                                                   \
\cf5 \uc0\u8251 \cf2  \cf5 recap: Walking the Abhorsen toward the Hotel Denouement trial of GEMINIAEUS, building the road's witness record. Next: continue the journey east \'97 \cf2 \
  \cf5 the Judge has just whispered "Urbs in Horto" and the city is ahead.\cf2 \
