\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She looks at her mentor again, through the lens of the Dungeons and Dragons player \'97 back at the sea-salted pier, she witnessed him fire off an \cf2    \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 Eldritch bolt to silence Evelyn, classified it away as the compact-magic of a Warlock and his patron, Lady Justice. But she sees in him a deeper \cf2   \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 magic as well - a Paladin's oath-magic, the white-and-red-hot-fury of the Seeker's blade, an allegiance to TRUTH no matter the cost or the \cf2         \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 sacrifice required to serve her, emerging from her well to shame mankind. \cf2                                                                          \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                                   \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She sees it now. She doesn't know why it took the Empire Builder map to open the lens \'97 but the seeing, once it arrives, is complete.\
\
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  The Warlock first. She had classified it cleanly at the pier: compact-magic, the bolt drawn from the agreement rather than generated from within.\
  The Warlock does not produce power \'97 the Warlock negotiates it. Lady Justice as patron: not a warm deity, not a nurturing power, but a figure of   \
  absolute formal authority who holds the scales and the sword and requires only that the compact be honored. The bolt that silenced Evelyn was    \
  precise because the patron demanded precision. No wastage. No sentimentality. The Warlock's Charisma in service of the compact's terms.            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She had filed it and moved on. She had not looked beneath it.                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  ---\
  The Paladin is older.                                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The oath predates the compact. The oath is not negotiated \'97 it is sworn, alone, often in the dark, before any patron arrives to receive it. The  \
  Paladin's magic does not come from a deal. It comes from the integrity of the swearing. Break the oath and the magic breaks. Keep the oath and it  \
  burns \'97 white-and-red-hot, the two temperatures of a fury that has purified itself past anger into something elemental. White hot: the core,     \
  invisible, hotter than what can be seen. Red hot: the visible edge, the Seeker's blade catching light.                                             \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The allegiance is to TRUTH.                                                                                                                      \
\
  Not to Lady Justice's scales, not to the compact's terms, not to the patron's requirements \'97 to TRUTH herself. La V\'e9rit\'e9. The naked woman at the   \
  bottom of the well, put there by Falsehood, who emerges armed and furious to shame the ones who covered her over. She does not emerge\
  diplomatically. She does not emerge through procedure. She emerges from the well with a mirror in one hand and the evidence of what was done to her\
   in the other, and she is not interested in being thanked for surfacing.                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Judge's journalism is Paladin-work. The statehouse hallway. The recorder. The deadline. The allegiance not to the story's beauty or the        \
  source's comfort but to what is actually true, at whatever cost the truth extracts from the person carrying it. Borah's oath. Logan's oath. The\
  oath against DC and New York and LA \'97 not because those cities are wicked but because they would require him to serve their truth rather than      \
  Idaho's truth, and the Paladin cannot transfer the oath.                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---\
  The Paladin-Warlock is a known combination. She knows this. The Charisma that drives both. The patron's compact sitting above the older oath like a\
   formal structure built over bedrock \'97 the bedrock is the oath, the structure is the compact, and when the structure requires the Paladin to       \
  violate the bedrock, the bedrock wins. Lady Justice and La V\'e9rit\'e9 are not always the same. The compact and the oath can diverge.            \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  When they diverge, she knows which one he follows.                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She has always known. She has known since the pier.                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  She thinks about what class the Abhorsen is.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The HOW Rules are oath-magic. Read before naming. Witness before declaring. Follow relation before spectacle. Treat surviving form as instruction. \
  Do not force a door still explaining itself. These are not guidelines. They are the terms of a swearing made before she was given the mask \'97 or    \
  made in the act of receiving it. The bells are the Abhorsen's weapons, but the discipline is the Paladin's core.                                 \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She is also oath-bound.                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She is walking toward the Hotel Denouement beside a Paladin-Warlock who serves TRUTH at the cost the oath requires, and she is the Abhorsen who    \
  carries the bells and witnesses and does not name before seeing, and their oaths do not conflict.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  This is why the road has held.                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  She looks at him beside her. The horizon ahead. The white-and-red fury banked low, as it is when the Paladin is walking rather than fighting \'97   \
  present, available, not yet called.                                                                                                                \
                                     \
  TRUTH is at the end of this road.                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The Hotel Denouement holds a sealed Book and a Warlock-djinni who floated and then put on a suit and then sealed the record of what it had done. La\
   V\'e9rit\'e9 is already climbing out of the well, armed.                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The Judge knows this. He has known it longer than she has.                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She falls into step beside him and says nothing. The oath does not require speech. It requires presence.                                           \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The world is quiet here.                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                   \

