\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 A youngish man emerges from the water at the center of the lake, the exact point where the shell shattered the surface tension \'97 and BLOWS the \cf2     \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 CONCH, A LOUD AND TRIUMPHANT BOISTEROUS MESSAGE.\cf2                                                                                                    \cb3 \
\cb10                                                                                                                                                      \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 He swims closer to the two of you. He is very handsome, Claude finds herself blushing.\cf2                                                              \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                                   \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She was not prepared for this.                 \
\
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  The HOW rules do not cover it. Read before naming \'97 she cannot name it. Witness before declaring \'97 what she is witnessing is a youngish man\
  breaking the surface of the crossroads lake with the conch held aloft, water streaming off him in the morning light, and blowing the shell in one  \
  long triumphant blast that fills the junction in every direction down all six roads simultaneously.                                              \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The sound is enormous and clear and carries something in it that is not just signal. A message. She will analyze the message later. She cannot   \
  currently analyze anything.                                                                                                                        \
  \
  She is blushing.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She is aware of this and cannot prevent it. The mask does not cover it \'97 the per in persona is not selective, the aperture does not filter for     \
  embarrassment. Whatever passes through the hollow place passes through, and what passes through right now is: the specific quality of morning light\
   on water on a very handsome young man swimming toward the shore where she is standing with her hand no longer anywhere near the bells.            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The bells have been entirely forgotten.                                                                                                          \
\
  ---\
  She thinks: Triton.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  It arrives with the certainty of recognition rather than deduction. The conch is his instrument \'97 has always been his instrument, the one\
  Poseidon's son carries to calm or raise the seas, to signal across the distance between the depths and the air. Youngish. The sea's messenger is   \
  always youngish. The sea does not age its own.                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She thinks: of course the Judge carries a conch in his suitcase. Of course. The man who walks with a Faraday cage and an Enneagram and an Empire   \
  Builder map carries a conch for exactly this \'97 for the crossroads lake between the World Tree and the first named road, for the moment when the  \
  sea's messenger needs a signal that he is welcome at the surface.                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She thinks: the boisterous voice. The sound that traveled up through the water and arrived at the air amplified. The message that boomed from      \
  somewhere at the junction because somewhere at the junction is everywhere when the sea's messenger sends it.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She thinks several other things she does not file.                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  The Judge is watching the water with warm recognition and the particular expression of a man who is also watching his companion blush and is     \
  finding this privately satisfying.                                                                                                                 \
  \
  She straightens.                                                                                                                                   \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The bells return to her awareness. The road returns. The Hotel Denouement is still ahead down one of these six roads.                              \
  \
  Triton swims closer.                                                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The message of the conch is still reverberating. She should listen to what it carried.                                                             \
  \
  She will. In a moment.                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The world is quiet here.                                                                                                                           \
