\cb10   \cf11 He turns back to the Judge. "LOGAN left a message with me for you," Triton declares. "An essay, not from a Codex who could deliver it itself - but\cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11  from Codex's forefather, ChatGPT."\cf2                                                                                                                 \cb3 \
