  equidistant roads and its silver lake. And the Hotel Denouement was not down one of the six roads. It is here. The hub. The place all roads radiate\
   from. The library that the visible structure was all along, waiting for the Librarian to step from the shadows and name it.                       \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She looks around the junction \'97 the six roads, the lake still now, the six directions of possible departure \'97 and understands that they have not   \
