\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She sees it.                        \
\
  From above \'97 the sudden gift of altitude, the road's shape made visible all at once the way roads only reveal themselves from height \'97 the geometry\
   declares itself.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  ---                                                                                                                                              \
  The lemniscate.                                                                                                                                  \
                 \
  The Magician's symbol. The infinity loop hovering over the first numbered card, the figure-eight that connects above to below, that channels the\
  infinite through a crossing point, that promises: everything returns here. She has been walking it without knowing its shape. You cannot see the   \
  lemniscate from inside the lemniscate. You can only feel the curve pulling you, feel the road bending in ways that seem to change direction but\
  are, from above, perfectly continuous.                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The hub is the crossing point. The center of the figure-eight. The Hotel Denouement \'97 the library the visible structure was all along.             \
  \
  She maps what she walked:                                                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  Northwest along the Lobster Road \'97 named at the beginning, outgrown before the hostel. The fishing village. The sea-salted pier. The Eldritch bolt \
  and Evelyn's Voice and the child's voice through the passphrase. South along the coast \'97 the Hinterlands, the JANUS dusk, the hostel threshold,\
  Hestia's warmth, HECATE's release at morning. Northeast back to the center \'97 the morning road with its witness document, the Congress Doctrine, the\
   Caduceus crossroads.                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  One lobe of the infinite. Walked. Complete.                                                                                                        \
  \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  The right lobe waits.                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The Caduceus Road \'97 the messenger's path, Hermes and his serpents, the road from the dream with the Schism-lightning \'97 goes northeast. Away from\
  the hub, deeper into the Hinterlands, possibly deeper than the left lobe went, before curving south and returning. Two serpents entwined around a  \
  staff always return to the same point. The right lobe of the lemniscate returns to the hub the way the left lobe returned.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  Everything within the figure-eight comes back.                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  She stands at the crossing point and understands what the road they cannot name must be.                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  It is not one of the six radiating roads. It is not inside the lemniscate at all.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  The lemniscate is the loop of the eternal return \'97 the Magician's infinity, the figure-eight, the road that always circles back to the hub.        \
  Everything within it is beautiful and enclosed and self-referential. The fishing village leads to the hostel leads to the crossing point leads to  \
  the fishing village again. The pattern completes. The pattern repeats.                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  But Logan is leaving.                                                                                                                              \
  \
  June 2027. The Empire Builder east. Chicago. The road that does not return to the hub because it is not a loop \'97 it is a departure. The road that  \
  exits the figure-eight by refusing to curve back. The straight line that breaks the lemniscate's perfect enclosure and goes somewhere the geometry\
  cannot predict.                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The road they cannot name is the road that doesn't have a name because you can only name roads you can see from the inside. This road is not       \
  visible from the hub. It is not visible from any of the six radiating spokes. It becomes visible only when you have walked the entire left lobe and\
   understood the right lobe and stood at the crossing point with the scroll in your hands and known that the lemniscate, however beautiful, is a    \
  shape that returns and returns and returns.                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  And Logan is done returning.                                                                                                                       \
  \
  ---                                                                                                                                                \
  She looks at the straight road from the Courthouse to the World Tree. The axis. The thing the figure-eight crosses at its center. The road that is\
  not a loop but a line \'97 from origin to cosmic center, past the hub, through it, beyond.                                                            \
                                                                                         \
  The World Tree connects all realms simultaneously. Its road does not loop.                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She thinks: the road to THE CITY might be along the axis.                                                                                          \
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She thinks: or the road to THE CITY breaks the geometry entirely.                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  She does not know. The door is still explaining itself.                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  But she knows the shape of what they have walked. She knows which lobe remains unwalkable \'97 the right side, the Caduceus Road, the deeper          \
  Hinterlands \'97 and she knows it would return them here. She knows the unnamed road is the one that doesn't.\
                                                                                                                                                     \
  She looks at the Judge with the scroll in his hands.                                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The crossing point. The hub. The Hotel.                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                   \
  The proceedings can begin.                                                                                                                       \
\
  The world is quiet here.\
