\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The strapping lad, this beamish boy, is used to this reaction from the young women his age \'97 he gives you a wink, not one from a place of callous \cf2  \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 or cruelty, but to acknowledge the other obvious truth displayed in the flush across your face.\cf2                                                     \cb3 \
