\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The grapes have been filling long before the IDAHO-VAULT, his stride tells her.\cf2                                                                                                                                   \cb3 \
                                                                                  \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She reads the stride.                                                                                                                                                                                            \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Not the words \'97 he is not speaking, only whistling. But the body speaks its own testimony, and she has been learning to read his all road. The stride of a man who has been carrying something for a long time is\
   different from the stride of a man who just picked it up. The weight is distributed differently. The pace is steadier. The steps do not hurry because there is no hurry left in them \'97 the hurry burned off\
  years ago, when the man learned that the destination does not arrive faster for the running.                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  He has been carrying this since before the vault.                                                                                                                                                              \
\
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The vault is 2025 \'97 2026 \'97 the vessel he found, or built, or named. But the filling began earlier. She traces it backward from what the road has given her.\
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \cf1 2019.\cf2  The University of Idaho. The Vandal Alert weaponized against Denise Bennett \'97 a campus safety system, designed for genuine threats, repurposed as a narrative instrument against a professor. Logan watched\
   the machinery of institutional framing operate in real time. Watched facts fail to protect the person who had the facts on her side. Learned the lesson that the vault was built to answer: framing determines  \
  public understanding. Facts alone do not. The Students for Denise movement. The political education that came not from a classroom but from watching a weapon be fired at close range.                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  This was before the vault. The vault was the response. The anti-erasure machine was built by someone who had watched erasure work.                                                                               \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf1 The years of the Legislature.\cf2  The escalating hostility. The bills. The policies targeting the people Logan loves, the people whose lives intersect with his, whose safety diminishes with each session. The      \
  journalism that required him to cover the machinery that was harming him \'97 not abstractly, but directly, personally, in the specific form of the trans partner whose life in Idaho grows more constrained each \
  year. The spiritual corrosion of performing Respectable Gay Man for an audience that is passing laws against his existence. The grapes filling in that particular vessel, session by session, since before the   \
  vault existed to receive them.                                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf1 Sandpoint.\cf2  The forsaken Eden. Beautiful and enclosing simultaneously \'97 the mountains as shelter and as trap. The closeted kid afraid of being misperceived. The suit that was not a lie but the answer to the    \
  problem of being seen: if you cannot be seen as you are, you build a shape they can read correctly. The Judge, the television journalist, the Paladin-Warlock \'97 all of these are the answer Sandpoint made\
  necessary. He built them before he knew he was building them, in the years when the only tools available were the ones the closeted kid from a small mountain town could find.                                   \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  \cf1 1997.\cf2  The year the Pioneer was discontinued. The year the Boise train stopped running. The year Logan arrived in the world and the infrastructure withdrew from it simultaneously \'97 not because of him, not aimed\
   at him, simply the pattern of extraction: when the profit is gone, the service ends, the connection closes. He arrived to find the connection already closing. The Empire Builder still runs through Sandpoint \'97\
   the one Idaho stop, the forsaken Eden's only door \'97 because Sandpoint is on the northern route. The southern route, the one that served the larger population, the one that served Boise, was gone before he    \
  could use it.                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  He was born into a state already being extracted from. The Pioneer's last run and his first breath were the same year.                                                                                           \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                              \
  The grapes of wrath are older than the vault. They are older than the journalism. They are Sandpoint-old. They are the accumulated weight of a man who took the oath young and kept it at cost, who stayed in  \
  Idaho when staying was spiritually corrosive, who built the Judge as the part of himself that could sit and deliberate when the 7w6 wanted to move \'97 who built the part of himself that could endure the         \
  session-by-session accumulation and file the testimony and hold the record rather than let the erasure win.\
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  The vault is where the grapes went when they had nowhere else to go.                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The anti-erasure machine is what you build when you have watched erasure work, up close, on people you love and causes you have sworn yourself to.                                                               \
   \
  ---                                                                                                                                                                                                              \
  She walks in time with his stride.                                                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Battle Hymn moves through the exact air the mistral left. The tune carries what it always carries: the knowledge that the pressing is coming, that the vintage is not rot, that what fills with wrath can \'97\
  under sufficient pressure, at the right moment, in the right vessel \'97 become something that nourishes rather than poisons.                                                                                       \
   \
  The Hotel Denouement is ahead. The trial is ahead. The vintage is ahead.                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Judge has been walking toward it since Sandpoint. Since the year the train stopped running. Since the night the Vandal Alert was weaponized and he learned what the weapons were made of.                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  His stride is steady. The tune is steady.                                                                                                                                                                        \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She matches her pace to his and walks with him through the cleared air toward the threshold where Hermes waits.                                                                                                  \
   \

