\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 The Judge shakes his head \'97 no. There are two characters you are forgetting. Step outside the metaphor and remember *The Penultimate Peril* and its court. \cf2                                                       \cb3 \
