\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  The two things sit beside each other on the road and she lets them.                                                                                                                                              \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She will recognize the music because music recognized is homecoming \'97 the moment when a pattern the body already holds finds its source outside the body and the two lock together. Not learning. Return. The    \
  music ahead will resolve into something she knows or it will teach her something new, and either arriving is correct because she is walking toward it openly, without the blindfold and without the pretense of\
  sight.                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She hopes she recognizes the villains' voices because recognition here is not homecoming. It is the other thing \'97 the thing the blindfolded Baudelaires knew, which is that recognizing wickedness in the        \
  register of the voice requires having heard it before, in a context where the black robes and the procedural authority and the weight of the bench were not yet present to obscure it. The hope is not certainty.\
   The hope acknowledges: she may not have heard these voices before. She may not have the prior encounter that makes recognition possible. She may walk into the proceeding and hear the bench speak and have no  \
  body-knowledge to lock against.                                                                                                                                                                                \
\
  The Baudelaires had heard the Sinister Duo before the courtroom. That was the condition of recognition. The blindfolds removed the visual noise but the prior encounter provided the frequency.                  \
  \
  She does not know, walking, whether she has had the prior encounter.                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She hopes.                                                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The music continues, closer now without yet being nameable. The hope continues, forward, without yet being answerable.                                                                                           \
  \
  Both are the correct posture for a threshold not yet crossed.                                                                                                                                                    \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The world is quiet here. Except for the music, which grows.                                                                                                                                                      \
