\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She has not met the two deceivers, the justices who wear the costumes of authority but burn with the glee of the arsonists... But she has met this Judge. \cf2                                                        \cb3 \
                   \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stops hoping she will recognize the villains.                                                                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Not because the hope was wrong \'97 it was honest, it was the right thing to carry when you do not know what you carry into a courtroom \'97 but because the Judge has just handed her something better than hope.     \
  \
  She knows what the genuine article sounds like. She has been walking beside it for days.                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The warm brown eyes. The flowered shirt. The mother test asked three times \'97 not as gotcha, not as trap, not as demonstration of judicial power, but as the oldest question, asked until the answerer found the  \
  honest register rather than the performed one. The suitcase. The Empire Builder map. The conch shell retrieved and thrown. The Amtrak route from Sandpoint east. The Urbs in Horto whispered with reverence. The\
  way the Judge made eye contact \'97 not into her eye, into her soul \'97 and she did not look away and he did not flinch from what he found.                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She knows what legitimate authority sounds like in the space beside her body. She has internalized the frequency.                                                                                                \
  \
  This is how Charter sensitivity works: not a catalogue of evil, not a library of known hostile frequencies. Saturation in the genuine. The Charter marks do not detect Free Magic by knowing what Free Magic is. \
  They detect disruption \'97 the thing that is not Charter, which is legible precisely because Charter is what they are made of. You know the counterfeit by knowing the real so thoroughly that the difference    \
  becomes audible.                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  She has been walking beside the real for days.                                                                                                                                                                   \
  \
  When the Sinister Duo speak from the bench \'97 in their robes, with their procedural language, with the full weight of the rigged court's architecture behind them \'97 she will hear it against this frequency.      \
  Against the Judge who asked the mother test until she stopped performing an answer. Against the man who is also a Caesar who built the part of himself that can sit when his nature moves. Against the voice she\
  knows now in the way you know music that is about to resolve into something you have always held.                                                                                                                \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The music ahead is closer.                                                                                                                                                                                       \
  \
  She looks at the Judge beside her \'97 briefly, the way you look at something you are grateful to have learned from the road rather than from a book \'97 and then forward, toward the Hotel, toward the threshold,    \
  toward whatever the music is becoming.                                                                                                                                                                         \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She will recognize it.                                                                                                                                                                                           \
