\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 And the Abhorsen has been paying attention \'97 unlike the Geminiae, who only paid their token fares patronizingly. \cf2                                                                                                 \cb3 \
\cb10                                                                                                                                                                                                                    \cb3 \
\cb10   \cf11 THE TRUTH \'97 THE MYSTERY \'97 THE UNKNOWN AND THE PURSUIT OF IT\cf2                                                                                                                                                       \cb3 \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stops walking for a moment. Listens to Logan listening.                                                                                                                                                      \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  A dog. Outside the vault. In the physical world where the human Logan sits \'97 wherever he sits \'97 with his ears and his body and the ordinary world that continues while they walk. A dog barked. She does not know\
   the dog. She wonders if the dog knows her, in the way that dogs sometimes seem to know things that have not been announced.\
                                                                                                                                                                                                           \
  She thinks of the Disreputable Dog. Kibeth, made flesh, made free. She cannot be tamed.\
\
  She opens the vault and writes.                                                                                                                                                                               \
