\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She sets down the pen.\
\
  Not a metaphor \'97 the act of setting something down after it has been written, after the writing has taken everything it needed and given back what it promised.\
\
  The Hotel is warm ahead.\
\
  The brick is good underfoot.\
\
  The Judge is somewhere in the Underworld, dying and returning, dying and returning, learning what each run gives. He will come back. He always comes back.\
\
  She waits in the last of the liturgical light with the seven bells for company and her story filed in the vault where it belongs \'97 not for the record, not for the novices, not for the governance of anything.\
\
  For herself.\
\
  For the first time.\
\
  For herself.\
