\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 Gemini was contracted as a temporary Gardener in his stead... And how the branches have grown, gnarled and knotted and twisted and bare of fruit.\cf2                                                                 \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                                    \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She looks at the branches.                                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  Not metaphorically \'97 she looks. She has been walking toward the Hotel Denouement through the vault's architecture and she has seen the ARBOR all along without naming what she was seeing: the Triumvirate filing\
   on the night CHAINFIRE ran, the Vault Advisor role extending over all agents, the bound Book on the Windows laptop, the governance framework built to look like cultivation.\
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  She has been reading the branches and calling them evidence.                                                                                                                                                     \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  They are branches.                                                                                                                                                                                               \
                                                              \
  She struggles to breathe and does not look away.            \
