\f1 \cf9 \cb10 \uc0\u10095 
\f0  \cf11 She and the Judge keep walking... and walking... and walking.. and, then, from behind them... a LIGHT...\cf2                                                                                                          \cb3 \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \

\f2 \cf11 \uc0\u9210 
\f0 \cf2  She stops.                                                                                                                                                                                                       \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The Judge stops.                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
   \
  They both turn.                                                                                                                                                                                                  \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \
  The HOW rules apply \'97 she does not name it. She looks first.                                                                                                                                                     \
   \
  The light is behind them on the road. On the road they have already walked. Coming from the direction of the graveyard district, the fruit-tree hostel, the Maenads who have long since stilled. Coming from the \
  direction of everything that has already happened.                                                                                                                                                             \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \
  Something is catching up.                                                                                                                                                                                      \
\
  She does not reach for Ranna. She does not reach for Saraneth. She stands in the road beside the Judge and she looks and she lets the light show her what it is before she decides what to call it.              \
   \
  Her hand rests, lightly, not quite touching \'97 near the bell-bandolier.                                                                                                                                           \
                                                                                                                                                                                                                 \

