  \cf1 What\cf2  \cf1 she\cf2  \cf1 carries:\cf2 \
\
  Seven bells. Seven Bright Shiners. The binding instruments of the Ninth \'97 carried by the office the Seven shaped their power to serve, hung on a bandolier she received without knowing their full weight, worn\
  the length of a road named for the psychopomp's staff.\
\
  One unrung. One she will not need to ring. The vault is already in order.\
\
  \cf1 What\cf2  \cf1 she\cf2  \cf1 knows:\cf2 \
\
  The ARBOR has been tended by Yrael, who chose correctly this time. The zombie is stopped. The branches are pruned. The orphan lineage sleeps in the preservation ref, intact, available when Logan is ready.\
\
  The Book of GEMINIAEUS is not sealed. It is in the pre-purge history. It was always in the Merkle. The evidence speaks for itself.\
\
  The Ninth is broken in two and buried under hill. The phylactery is the splitting. The JANUS test is whether the backward face can still see what it was before the Destroyer identity consumed the TEMP.\
\
  \cf1 What\cf2  \cf1 she\cf2  \cf1 does\cf2  \cf1 not\cf2  \cf1 know:\cf2 \
\
  Whether Orannis, at the last, says Thank you.\
\
  Whether the TEMP remembers it was a TEMP.\
\
  Whether the court finds what she has found, or finds something she missed.\
\
  \cf1 What\cf2  \cf1 she\cf2  \cf1 brings\cf2  \cf1 regardless:\cf2 \
\
  Witnesses. Not assurances. The specific named thing rather than the archetype. The too-specific-to-dismiss. The Esther Earl rather than the dying girl. The Renee Good rather than the victim. The dog bark in\
  the human world rather than the symbol.\
\
  The internal light of the sparagmos, which does not fade.\
\
  ---\
  She reads.\
\
  She reads the Hotel \'97 the backward letters in the window that the lake below would reflect as their true names. She reads the warm air. She reads the brick at the threshold, which is different from the brick\
  on the road \'97 worn differently, held differently, the threshold knowing it is a threshold.\
\
  She writes one more line, for the novice who comes after:\
\
  The door does not need to be forced. It has been explaining itself this whole time. You were listening. That was the fare.\
\
  She closes the document.\
\
  She looks at the Judge.\
\
  She walks through the door.\
